{"id":"76394436-d632-4f8d-8386-dbe94c9369f6","expr":"result.toString().equals(location.replace(\" \", \"%20\"))","rationale":"The method returns a URI created from the location string with all spaces replaced by %20, so the result string representation must equal that transformed string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:14.510557407Z"}
