{"id":"524ebce0-7716-4510-b3c7-fab547a6e559","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null URL if it completes normally.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:14.552109784Z"}
