{"id":"4c4ef1c5-4dd6-4d87-a8b4-b148baeb163f","expr":"location != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null String to convert to a URL.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:14.923384511Z"}
{"id":"29a6eca0-db66-4060-bbe8-90d6416cb9ef","expr":"location.length() > 0","rationale":"An empty location string is likely invalid or meaningless for URL conversion.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:14.923384511Z"}
{"id":"177ebc50-3d10-4bda-b1b2-dc9f87e1668c","expr":"location.contains(\":\") || location.startsWith(\"/\")","rationale":"The location string likely contains a protocol scheme or is an absolute path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:14.923384511Z"}
{"id":"5e4b8031-2f96-4a3b-b6ce-0fa86ea35a5e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method logically returns a valid URL reference extracted from jarUrl or returns jarUrl itself, so result is never null at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#extractJarFileURL(URL):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:15.002477979Z"}
{"id":"c66746d3-d306-4c68-bac5-4d2cba137d15","expr":"result.toString().contains(\".jar\")","rationale":"The method extracts the jar file URL, so the string representation of result should include '.jar'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#extractJarFileURL(URL):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:15.002477979Z"}
{"id":"3e66a188-3872-444c-9988-0807f54f4620","expr":"root != null","rationale":"Since the method constructs a new URL from root, root must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:15.607233837Z"}
