{"id":"a214ef35-2696-401e-b99d-888d6daff552","expr":"root.toString().length() > 0","rationale":"A URL should convert to a non-empty string for further string-based manipulation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:15.607233837Z"}
{"id":"94ffa6fd-c3ec-43f7-80cf-5c95c8bbc51f","expr":"relativePath.indexOf('#') >= -1","rationale":"Ensures the string method indexOf can execute without error.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:15.607233837Z"}
{"id":"c0e34176-07b0-4ccf-aec8-226396d229c1","expr":"!(relativePath.contains(\"%23\")) || !relativePath.contains(\"#\")","rationale":"Ensures the relative path is normalized with respect to '#' characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:15.607233837Z"}
{"id":"93103da2-70bf-4604-9039-3bb90b5ade44","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a new URL object constructed from the root URL and a cleaned relative path, so result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:16.724249155Z"}
