{"id":"6bdd5fe8-bbb5-420d-8fdf-013df25eab74","expr":"messageDigest.getDigestLength() > 0","rationale":"A valid MessageDigest should have a non-zero digest length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.224914991Z"}
{"id":"bfea9575-518b-4026-a835-9bbb581f5afa","expr":"!messageDigest.getProvider().getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"The provider's name should not be empty for a valid MessageDigest.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.224914991Z"}
{"id":"fbf55d4c-37c6-4862-8a7c-53ae13af21a8","expr":"con != null","rationale":"The method uses 'con' and calls methods on it, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#useCachesIfNecessary(URLConnection):void","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.477964064Z"}
{"id":"5a5c9501-6a65-47b0-887d-9f47e1fb893a","expr":"pattern != null || str == null","rationale":"The first check in the method is if pattern or str is null, the method returns false, so logically if pattern is null then str should be null or method won't proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.487814815Z"}
{"id":"d49851db-4b9f-4f35-9ed0-94c3f040d19f","expr":"str != null || pattern == null","rationale":"From the null checks, if str is null then pattern must be null or method won't proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.487814815Z"}
{"id":"9254bfb0-4418-4b3b-a9b7-d66f44478137","expr":"ignoreCase == true || ignoreCase == false","rationale":"ignoreCase is boolean so inherently either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.487814815Z"}
{"id":"402928cc-a21b-4603-b893-b393e402e815","expr":"str != null && pattern != null","rationale":"The method starts by returning false if either pattern or str is null, so at the method entry, both may be possibly null but for meaningful processing both should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.487814815Z"}
{"id":"433b67a1-6168-445d-838a-c634e2d1dee4","expr":"pattern.indexOf('*') >= -1","rationale":"indexOf returns -1 if character is not found or non-negative integer if found, so the value is always >= -1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.487814815Z"}
{"id":"26499d03-da04-41f6-85b1-31af199a1079","expr":"(pattern != null && str != null) || !result","rationale":"The method returns false if either pattern or str is null, so if either is null, result is false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.497383324Z"}
{"id":"4f6c4ad0-767a-46e5-86e7-efd05873914c","expr":"result == (pattern != null && str != null && (pattern.indexOf('*') == -1 ? (ignoreCase ? pattern.equalsIgnoreCase(str) : pattern.equals(str)) : true))","rationale":"If pattern has no '*', result must equal the equality or equalsIgnoreCase check between pattern and str.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.497383324Z"}
{"id":"b689000c-2274-4b6a-b6ee-3ce5570823e0","expr":"result == true || (pattern != null && pattern.indexOf('*') >= 0) || (pattern != null && pattern.indexOf('*') == -1 && (ignoreCase ? !pattern.equalsIgnoreCase(str) : !pattern.equals(str)))","rationale":"When no wildcard and result is false, pattern does not match str by equality.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.497383324Z"}
{"id":"9f2a8335-f13b-4d3d-b1dc-57d2356efab0","expr":"result || (pattern != null && str != null && pattern.indexOf('*') >= 0 || (pattern == null || str == null))","rationale":"Result false and non-null inputs imply pattern has wildcards or null inputs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.497383324Z"}
{"id":"59987ca2-4add-436b-a081-a8b6e718ccb8","expr":"result == true || result == false","rationale":"Result is boolean so it can only be true or false. (This may be trivial but satisfies consistent type.)","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.497383324Z"}
{"id":"798eb9b4-de91-4632-a0f9-c790790cdc46","expr":"pattern != null","rationale":"The pattern string is expected to be non-null for meaningful substring match.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#checkStartsWith(String,String,int,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.504530992Z"}
