{"id":"34683b55-00c1-4665-9b6a-000d4d86305c","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"The substring end index must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#checkStartsWith(String,String,int,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.504530992Z"}
{"id":"5ff30252-3075-4e1d-bb54-a5c4222a3b83","expr":"index <= str.length()","rationale":"The substring end index must not exceed str length to prevent StringIndexOutOfBoundsException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#checkStartsWith(String,String,int,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.504530992Z"}
{"id":"ada33d69-7dac-42d1-bc61-172605052762","expr":"!(result && (str.length() < index))","rationale":"If result is true, then str must be at least as long as index to have that substring.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#checkStartsWith(String,String,int,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.511335381Z"}
{"id":"99c01e61-a96a-44b1-914a-15b21d866821","expr":"str != null","rationale":"str must not be null since the method calls str.indexOf and str.regionMatches.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#indexOf(String,String,int,boolean):int","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.519686271Z"}
{"id":"a23f6c5e-eded-48f0-8afe-b640daabbf2d","expr":"otherStr != null","rationale":"otherStr must not be null since the method uses otherStr.length() and str.regionMatches with otherStr.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#indexOf(String,String,int,boolean):int","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.519686271Z"}
{"id":"0134e7e2-50ca-4752-87fd-48e8dd8bbd65","expr":"startIndex >= 0","rationale":"startIndex is expected to be non-negative because it is used as an index in str.indexOf and in the loop.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#indexOf(String,String,int,boolean):int","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.519686271Z"}
{"id":"37b7470e-54e2-456f-8184-e9960889d0e6","expr":"startIndex <= str.length()","rationale":"startIndex should be at most the length of str, because otherwise indexOf or the loop might behave unexpectedly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#indexOf(String,String,int,boolean):int","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.519686271Z"}
{"id":"6bc328a5-3fd4-474c-9a81-9f36ae2506e2","expr":"ignoreCase == false || (ignoreCase == true && str.length() >= otherStr.length())","rationale":"The loop condition requires str.length() - otherStr.length() to be >= startIndex, so if ignoreCase is true, str must be long enough to allow the loop.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#indexOf(String,String,int,boolean):int","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.519686271Z"}
{"id":"327daa25-f71b-489e-aef3-9168f3b50446","expr":"result == -1 || (result >= startIndex && result <= str.length() - otherStr.length())","rationale":"The result is either -1 indicating no match, or a valid starting index of the match within bounds.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#indexOf(String,String,int,boolean):int","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.528680906Z"}
{"id":"27ff4fcf-20b9-4e0f-a76f-7c075638d9a9","expr":"result == -1 || str.regionMatches(ignoreCase, result, otherStr, 0, otherStr.length())","rationale":"Confirms that the returned index points to a substring matching otherStr with respect to case sensitivity requested.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#indexOf(String,String,int,boolean):int","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.528680906Z"}
{"id":"1cb2317e-9840-4f83-869d-24a540f5e2b4","expr":"result >= -1 && result < str.length()","rationale":"Ensures the result is a valid index or the special -1 value.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#indexOf(String,String,int,boolean):int","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.528680906Z"}
{"id":"77c21052-e4db-4fe6-bb58-97dffbe50f3a","expr":"messageDigest != null","rationale":"The method updates the provided MessageDigest instance, so it must be non-null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.638278287Z"}
{"id":"11a29c2d-beb5-480a-815f-1817d59f80de","expr":"messageDigest.getAlgorithm() != null","rationale":"The MessageDigest should have a valid algorithm set, which is required for its functioning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.638278287Z"}
{"id":"bf46b5c9-1f56-4cc3-85bd-e2901ad43a07","expr":"messageDigest.getDigestLength() > 0","rationale":"The digest length should be positive as per the contract of MessageDigest.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.638278287Z"}
{"id":"11dc41aa-20aa-482b-8d37-ccec376f48d6","expr":"messageDigest.getProvider() != null","rationale":"The Provider of the MessageDigest must be present.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:17.638278287Z"}
{"id":"e4a5f4f4-9175-4648-96fd-ed471ddd2f30","expr":"messageDigest != null","rationale":"The messageDigest parameter must be non-null to call update on it safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:18.422748504Z"}
