{"id":"9a14a37c-f432-4366-b790-3ebee5f90418","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method creates a start element with the QName 'name', so 'name' must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#startElementInternal(QName,Attributes,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.386496121Z"}
