{"id":"63a525e2-8f77-430c-845c-eb19e2ff0520","expr":"namespaceMapping != null","rationale":"The method calls getNamespaces(namespaceMapping), so 'namespaceMapping' must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#startElementInternal(QName,Attributes,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.386496121Z"}
{"id":"6ed24f15-4f7b-4f44-a7ec-ca6c7177cba6","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The QName parameter 'name' is used to create a start element event, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#startElementInternal(QName,Attributes,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.400314645Z"}
{"id":"0915e0e7-5403-466d-8c01-4105b9ab883e","expr":"atts == null || atts.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"The attributes may be null or have a non-negative length, representing the number of XML attributes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#startElementInternal(QName,Attributes,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.400314645Z"}
{"id":"a6e5d3bd-7d14-43ec-ab00-f51343a801a9","expr":"namespaceMapping == null || !namespaceMapping.containsKey(null)","rationale":"The namespace mapping is a Map<String,String>, so null keys are disallowed and should not be present.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#startElementInternal(QName,Attributes,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.400314645Z"}
{"id":"d484e08e-1a8e-4280-8043-ff84f05779ed","expr":"namespaceMappings != null","rationale":"The method uses namespaceMappings without null checks, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getNamespaces(Map<String, String>):List<Namespace>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.412384813Z"}
{"id":"b8cc94a6-ad31-496e-aeec-8e990000c9b5","expr":"namespaceMappings.size() >= 0","rationale":"The size of the Map cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getNamespaces(Map<String, String>):List<Namespace>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.412384813Z"}
{"id":"75df1ab5-4269-4d5d-8839-acc58eacc6e3","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a List of Namespace objects.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getNamespaces(Map<String, String>):List<Namespace>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.423882311Z"}
{"id":"a6cea87e-bdf1-430b-8005-5176779c594a","expr":"result.size() == (namespaceMappings != null ? namespaceMappings.size() : 0)","rationale":"The size of the result list matches the size of the input map.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getNamespaces(Map<String, String>):List<Namespace>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.423882311Z"}
{"id":"02ad7f25-3cdf-4efc-b92f-8ae62113065d","expr":"(!result.isEmpty()) == (namespaceMappings != null && !namespaceMappings.isEmpty())","rationale":"Result is non-empty if and only if namespaceMappings is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getNamespaces(Map<String, String>):List<Namespace>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.423882311Z"}
{"id":"ab6c2893-21bb-409f-b093-75686a5f3035","expr":"attributes != null","rationale":"To safely call methods on attributes, it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.434688976Z"}
{"id":"d0e488d4-065b-457f-a74f-cadc23096796","expr":"attributes.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"The number of attributes reported should never be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.434688976Z"}
{"id":"ecd31dc4-bf45-485d-ad82-255b5d5b1c3e","expr":"attributes.getLength() == attributes.getLength()","rationale":"This is trivial and should be omitted.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.434688976Z"}
{"id":"b2e71d9f-b456-43f6-bd56-7707f221bc14","expr":"!attributes.getQName(0).isEmpty() || attributes.getLength() == 0","rationale":"This reflects a relationship between the attribute length and its QName.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.434688976Z"}
{"id":"906e4eb4-ddcb-428e-be24-3f2acca74376","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always initializes and returns a non-null List.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.444959231Z"}
{"id":"ee860e3d-2f1d-451c-99a8-082a131157cd","expr":"result.size() <= attributes.getLength()","rationale":"For each attribute in 'attributes', at most one corresponding Attribute is added to result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.444959231Z"}
{"id":"1b7cf46c-692a-42df-b324-758af7045e67","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || attributes.getLength() == 0","rationale":"If attributes has length zero, result is empty, otherwise may contain elements.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.444959231Z"}
{"id":"86d1d35f-5b6d-481c-8bd7-7d7bca1b5832","expr":"name != null","rationale":"name must be non-null because it is passed to createEndElement which requires a QName.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.455927811Z"}
{"id":"c7bf11d9-5212-4612-bb18-9e725a3c530e","expr":"namespaceMapping != null","rationale":"namespaceMapping must be non-null because getNamespaces is invoked with it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.455927811Z"}
{"id":"dcd8cd97-4f60-4bfa-a1ab-3a3b305869a0","expr":"name.getLocalPart() != null","rationale":"QName's local part is expected not to be null for valid qualified names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.455927811Z"}
{"id":"8c7c89c4-df8d-42ed-bd13-a341f2c86da3","expr":"namespaceMapping != null && !namespaceMapping.isEmpty()","rationale":"At method exit, namespaceMapping is expected to be non-null and not empty as used to call getNamespaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.466635671Z"}
{"id":"6639d970-21a8-44b5-a3a7-364aa6111e95","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The QName name parameter should be non-null for this method to complete normally.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.466635671Z"}
{"id":"58f989e7-6c76-4dde-ad1a-5bdee9337a99","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The method calls createCharacters(data), which likely requires data to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.476169446Z"}
{"id":"734b0910-39b5-4663-9f3d-51b6d088e707","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"Since data is a String, its length property must be at least 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.476169446Z"}
{"id":"9fa23ce0-c9dc-40db-8147-25ae5de5085f","expr":"data.isEmpty() || data.length() > 0","rationale":"Covers the logical partition of data being empty or not.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.476169446Z"}
{"id":"5b0f8f65-cfef-4127-a9b0-5084e3adf504","expr":"data.indexOf('\\0') == -1","rationale":"In XML context, null characters are generally not allowed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.476169446Z"}
{"id":"11633935-52be-483f-9901-cc3eec0ad70e","expr":"data != null","rationale":"Since data is directly passed to createCharacters method, it is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.486125047Z"}
{"id":"33450a34-449d-42a4-baa7-77d50486b572","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"data is a String and thus its length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.486125047Z"}
{"id":"6a3f7aa1-6f21-4bed-aa17-16b57535c4d9","expr":"data.equals(data.trim()) || data.trim().length() < data.length()","rationale":"character data can include leading or trailing whitespace or not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.486125047Z"}
{"id":"88f8e73d-c97a-4e2d-a9f8-f789be571843","expr":"data != null && !data.isEmpty() || data.isEmpty()","rationale":"data can be empty or not empty; this invariant is trivial but included for completeness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.486125047Z"}
{"id":"d0dbc2bf-7391-428e-89a4-7ea26f9defd0","expr":"data != null && !data.contains(\"]]>\")","rationale":"CDATA content should not include ']]>' to maintain valid XML.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.496192018Z"}
{"id":"b07be9ec-0210-40f2-a24a-ddfddf4a161c","expr":"data != null && !data.isEmpty()","rationale":"Method likely expects non-empty data string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.496192018Z"}
{"id":"3779fffe-4859-4738-a436-55b749b0bc95","expr":"data != null && data.indexOf('<') >= 0 || data.indexOf('&') >= 0","rationale":"Data likely contains characters that require CDATA encapsulation to avoid XML escaping.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.496192018Z"}
{"id":"344462e9-e5d6-49ef-b754-7a504fd6d79b","expr":"data != null","rationale":"Since data is passed to createCData, it is expected to be non-null for the method to work correctly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.507356258Z"}
{"id":"13ea2f0c-7222-4407-9caf-1f8487b51978","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"Basic invariant that string length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.507356258Z"}
{"id":"4795d4d8-b2dd-41eb-9fc9-9bd8a9862472","expr":"data.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"CDATA content is usually non-empty after trimming whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.507356258Z"}
{"id":"41086712-7967-40db-9a9e-504338684828","expr":"data != null","rationale":"To safely create an ignorable space event from data, the data string should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.521654497Z"}
{"id":"64f82f1d-8815-469b-9a30-5f49ecd45e0e","expr":"data.trim().isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the method is ignorableWhitespaceInternal, the input string likely contains only whitespace, so trimming it results in empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.521654497Z"}
{"id":"dba628e8-5952-43a7-9602-649668aadebb","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The data parameter must be non-null because it is passed directly to createIgnorableSpace without checks.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.531079748Z"}
{"id":"7fa6e501-3344-43a9-b81d-4de4c5653a52","expr":"data.length() > 0","rationale":"It is expected that ignorable whitespace has length greater than zero at this point since it was processed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.531079748Z"}
{"id":"490fb980-8e1d-469f-af31-dac9e85e12bc","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The method creates a processing instruction using target, so target is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.540872241Z"}
{"id":"ed8405ce-4928-48d3-a5ee-324d10275b7c","expr":"data == null || !data.contains(\"?>\")","rationale":"As data becomes the content of the processing instruction, it should not contain '?>' which ends the instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.540872241Z"}
{"id":"b5306326-ac29-4f57-b53e-8aadcb311756","expr":"target.length() > 0","rationale":"For a processing instruction, target must be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.540872241Z"}
{"id":"97f44983-1742-41a3-9cb0-c4a84df133e7","expr":"data == null || data.length() >= 0","rationale":"data can be null or a string of any length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.540872241Z"}
{"id":"e19167a3-fc58-45e4-9540-655dbf7bea3d","expr":"!target.contains(\"<?\")","rationale":"The target string should not contain '<?' which denotes start of XML processing instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.540872241Z"}
{"id":"b57bbb3b-0912-4df4-9472-6308aa43b03f","expr":"target != null && !target.isEmpty()","rationale":"The target string is typically required to identify the processing instruction and should be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.551321172Z"}
{"id":"614aeece-4a6e-48e0-ac97-a8049dda4c1f","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The data string can be empty but is generally non-null to avoid creating invalid processing instructions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.551321172Z"}
{"id":"2bf8fb90-3f0b-4780-ab66-434ba50353ed","expr":"target.length() <= 1000","rationale":"Targets are usually short strings, and imposing an upper bound can reflect typical usage.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.551321172Z"}
{"id":"8a1b8e1b-ac2a-4151-871a-1161341824aa","expr":"dtd != null","rationale":"The method creates a DTD event with dtd as input; dtd must be non-null for createDTD to succeed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.564890286Z"}
{"id":"45431cb0-f76a-4920-a964-da0b51a49c36","expr":"dtd.length() >= 0","rationale":"The input string length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.564890286Z"}
{"id":"dce5c4ec-04b4-4740-bfdc-c1383fc31e62","expr":"dtd != null","rationale":"The method creates a DTD event using dtd string and adds it to eventWriter, so dtd must be a valid non-null XML DTD string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.577567920Z"}
{"id":"57386951-a2b9-47ce-b128-feed6c88e80b","expr":"dtd.contains(\"[\") == dtd.contains(\"]\")","rationale":"An internal subset DTD syntax uses square brackets, so if one bracket exists, the other should as well for well-formedness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.577567920Z"}
{"id":"23af135b-8aa3-447e-8a25-6da109125e0a","expr":"dtd.length() > 0","rationale":"An empty string does not form a valid DTD; thus the string should have length greater than zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.577567920Z"}
{"id":"48247c8f-bbe9-42fc-a7f1-37d54bcd01b9","expr":"!dtd.contains(\"<?\")","rationale":"Processing instructions are a separate XML construct and unlikely part of a DTD content string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.577567920Z"}
{"id":"5cdcfc58-4d44-4d08-88b7-6c103d3bab0a","expr":"comment != null","rationale":"To create a valid XML comment, the comment string should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.590762968Z"}
{"id":"03ab6fdc-3dfe-4db9-a503-68b5257e6fe6","expr":"comment.indexOf(\"--\") == -1","rationale":"The string used for an XML comment should not contain the sequence \"--\" as it is invalid in XML comments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.590762968Z"}
{"id":"00ef8bb7-6b92-46d9-896c-e8c74500edc8","expr":"comment.length() >= 0","rationale":"By definition, string length is never negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.590762968Z"}
{"id":"fdbfbd3e-bc84-4df2-9dae-66c229c3d961","expr":"!comment.endsWith(\"-\")","rationale":"To prevent invalid XML comment termination that might interfere with comment syntax.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:38:43.590762968Z"}
