{"id":"96b2e7fe-f17b-4d09-81f6-65749c72bf89","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.length() >= 0","rationale":"If prefix is not null, its length is at least zero","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endPrefixMapping(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.721137278Z"}
{"id":"82bd7817-ff47-40f2-aa85-c17fc46df45f","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.trim().length() >= 0","rationale":"If prefix is not null, trimming it results in a string with length at least zero","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endPrefixMapping(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.721137278Z"}
{"id":"e9145f7c-1424-4741-bdc1-b5746fa98296","expr":"qName != null","rationale":"startElement is usually called with qName being non-null as it's the qualified XML name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.738928823Z"}
{"id":"3bca95c0-fe7c-47e9-b3b0-3c29daaed9bd","expr":"(uri == null) || qName.startsWith(uri)","rationale":"If the namespace URI is present, qName often starts with it or incorporates it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.738928823Z"}
{"id":"da9231b6-9730-4d2b-b6f8-e270cdd0ec0e","expr":"localName != null","rationale":"Local name in XML parsing is required and typically non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.738928823Z"}
{"id":"cf76ad15-6a7a-4b80-92e3-4a97a19d0798","expr":"atts != null","rationale":"Attributes parameter is likely always non-null to represent attribute list.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.738928823Z"}
{"id":"c98dfa3a-8360-45d7-a392-02afedc05dbd","expr":"atts.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"Attributes length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.738928823Z"}
{"id":"08ae978e-d234-457c-8bcb-8e84a6e236e3","expr":"qName != null && !qName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The qName parameter is expected to be a valid XML qualified name, therefore non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.744215461Z"}
{"id":"68bf024b-934d-4459-8d4b-e379067458e6","expr":"uri != null","rationale":"The uri parameter representing the namespace URI should not be null after method processing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.744215461Z"}
{"id":"90c5e3e8-ee3f-4f4e-8657-c3d281c0ac93","expr":"localName != null && !localName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The localName parameter should be non-null and non-empty as it identifies the element's local name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.744215461Z"}
{"id":"92393fe1-61ac-4880-a13e-c915d5c904f3","expr":"atts != null","rationale":"The atts parameter should be a valid Attributes object, not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.744215461Z"}
{"id":"dfe83fc8-098b-4cbb-9e8e-c5e9cb6ff6fc","expr":"atts.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"The atts object represents the attributes of the element and getLength returns the count, which should not be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.744215461Z"}
{"id":"672e1c89-6bf1-4eb8-8135-d4452d7ba61f","expr":"uri != null || (localName != null && qName != null)","rationale":"Either uri is provided, or both localName and qName are provided, to identify the element.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.754071403Z"}
{"id":"c4b7ee4a-a653-4495-8aff-15c0e60d6cfb","expr":"(qName == null) || qName.length() > 0","rationale":"If qName is provided, it is not empty, representing a qualified XML name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.754071403Z"}
{"id":"98aedf05-51bf-4f3e-a48b-9cea519cdabe","expr":"(localName == null) || localName.length() >= 0","rationale":"localName is a string representing the local part of the element name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.754071403Z"}
{"id":"85d5aa30-fa2c-4cee-a4d5-eb28609cff9a","expr":"uri == null || uri.length() >= 0","rationale":"uri is a namespace URI string, can be null or non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.754071403Z"}
{"id":"b5dced4a-00d0-4e5e-a466-15aeb7b0e207","expr":"(localName != null || qName != null)","rationale":"To identify the element, either localName or qName should be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.754071403Z"}
{"id":"cde46872-80d4-4399-88b0-2818be280ca5","expr":"uri != null && (qName == null || qName.contains(localName))","rationale":"Qualified name 'qName' typically includes the namespace prefix followed by ':' and then the localName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.758106792Z"}
{"id":"5d100fae-f881-4070-ae40-fdb887bf2d13","expr":"localName != null && !localName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Because endElement is called on a specific element, localName is expected to be a meaningful non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.758106792Z"}
{"id":"5304c750-4d22-484a-9761-21b8662746c7","expr":"(qName == null || !qName.isEmpty())","rationale":"qName should not be an empty string, since it represents the qualified name of element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.758106792Z"}
{"id":"2bf3c4ff-95a0-48bc-813c-c58954248814","expr":"uri != null || (localName != null && qName != null)","rationale":"This captures that either the namespace URI exists or both localName and qName do, assuming namespace awareness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.758106792Z"}
{"id":"94296832-0247-436d-bf2c-581ef7982e6b","expr":"qName == null || qName.startsWith(uri) || !uri.isEmpty()","rationale":"Ensures consistent relationship between uri and qName's prefix (though not guaranteed in all contexts)","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.758106792Z"}
{"id":"97dff687-4638-40c2-b22c-acc2bcaa3895","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The input character array must be non-null because the String constructor called with (char[], int, int) throws NullPointerException if ch is null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.769028895Z"}
{"id":"09d7a108-f9b1-4eac-83a3-e6033a542358","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"The start index must be non-negative as it is used by the String constructor to indicate the starting index in the character array","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.769028895Z"}
{"id":"479ffc39-af86-479b-8057-fdcadc6543f3","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"The length parameter must be non-negative because it is the count of characters to use from the char array to create the string","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.769028895Z"}
{"id":"8d6d4306-35a9-4cb1-af1e-d51aa867c047","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The sum of start and length must be <= ch.length for the constructor new String(ch, start, length) to be valid and not raise an IndexOutOfBoundsException","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.769028895Z"}
{"id":"999ff88c-84e3-4235-b62c-391463f026df","expr":"length == 0 || start < ch.length","rationale":"If length is positive then start must be less than array length otherwise the substring is invalid","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.769028895Z"}
{"id":"131efbed-56d5-47ef-b289-f995c06c6dc0","expr":"ch != null && start >= 0 && length >= 0 && start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"Safe construction of the String from the char array with given start and length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.772058657Z"}
{"id":"d5c3461e-8624-4f86-9ff4-14b3f71173e6","expr":"length == 0 || ch.length > 0","rationale":"If 'length' is positive, 'ch' must contain characters to extract from.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.772058657Z"}
{"id":"bd32766e-f6ce-4998-bf32-7f9c3191fabe","expr":"start <= ch.length","rationale":"Ensuring start index is within char array bounds.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.772058657Z"}
{"id":"fb3d5183-ea90-4c70-8160-8dd0f29d6a63","expr":"length <= ch.length","rationale":"Logical bound check for length relative to the char array size.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.772058657Z"}
{"id":"dfb6fdd5-a22b-4beb-8549-de3bf5ee06c3","expr":"start + length >= 0","rationale":"Ensures the parameters to String constructor are non-negative and valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.772058657Z"}
{"id":"5e052305-2140-41c2-ba0c-c167a383b881","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The array 'ch' must be non-null to create a new String from it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.782350462Z"}
{"id":"79f84f48-22a5-4b7e-83f7-35fb02ffc625","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"'start' must be zero or positive to be a valid index into the array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.782350462Z"}
{"id":"c91b3150-6bd4-4236-a05a-daa60d68ba07","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"'length' must be zero or positive for the substring length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.782350462Z"}
{"id":"1cbef5c5-42b6-4532-a344-bc34f34c63bd","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The substring from 'start' to 'start + length' must fit inside 'ch' array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.782350462Z"}
{"id":"15211c3d-846b-4441-88a8-fa610b5e8306","expr":"start >= 0 && length >= 0","rationale":"start and length are used to create a substring from the char array, so both must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.784917452Z"}
{"id":"2c9977a8-4572-4679-afa3-43634dd54c42","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The constructor String(ch, start, length) requires ch to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.784917452Z"}
{"id":"758534c4-ea47-4046-80c5-b036387e3e2a","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"To safely create new String(ch, start, length), the boundaries must be inside ch.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.784917452Z"}
{"id":"bedeaff4-713c-45f3-b939-1c126b2157fc","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The processingInstructionInternal method likely requires a non-null target to identify the target of the processing instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.794527962Z"}
{"id":"9deb450d-4b02-4080-86b0-31bc814b9846","expr":"data != null","rationale":"Since data is passed to processingInstructionInternal, it is plausible that data must be at least a valid string, possibly empty but not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.794527962Z"}
{"id":"63617333-3ce6-4753-96d1-fd7246cdfe57","expr":"target.length() > 0","rationale":"Processing instructions generally have a non-empty target to specify the instruction name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.794527962Z"}
{"id":"176fb57c-e353-4556-8fb4-9b3077933491","expr":"!target.contains(\"<?\")","rationale":"The target string should not contain processing instruction start delimiters which might be invalid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.794527962Z"}
{"id":"e62a389c-31d3-4863-9d06-12b2d1ca33d3","expr":"data.isEmpty() || data != null","rationale":"Since data is a string parameter, it might be empty or non-null when passed to the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.794527962Z"}
{"id":"8e115d19-6db1-4abc-9277-15ac94fef128","expr":"target != null && data != null || target == null || data == null","rationale":"method is called with target and data; the exceptions thrown indicate that the method likely expects target and data to be passed along","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.796564181Z"}
{"id":"5f811d35-3cd0-48ef-b487-9e4c62056d4c","expr":"target != null && !target.isEmpty() || target == null || target.isEmpty()","rationale":"target is expected to be a non-empty processing instruction target string or possibly empty but still processed","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.796564181Z"}
{"id":"1d365776-2eba-4f74-be5d-4b4bad4c578c","expr":"data != null && data.length() >= 0","rationale":"data is a string and length is non-negative if data is non-null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.796564181Z"}
{"id":"19d73705-703f-4164-90c1-d0438ea9e20a","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method uses 'name' in a method call 'skippedEntityInternal(name)', so nullness is relevant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.805753376Z"}
{"id":"1b483a9a-753f-4c0e-bc97-b9953bcdb79c","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Entity names in XML are usually non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.805753376Z"}
{"id":"83c79fbe-7904-450a-b971-94d5f3a65ff6","expr":"!name.contains(\" \")","rationale":"XML entity names typically are tokens without whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.805753376Z"}
{"id":"ddf18387-7ace-44c3-9ba5-1b1428da1348","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0","rationale":"The skippedEntity method is only meaningful if name is non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.808630481Z"}
{"id":"00899970-a6ec-428e-b4ed-ec9ebeb023e3","expr":"name == null || name.indexOf(' ') == -1","rationale":"XML entity names do not contain whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.808630481Z"}
{"id":"d363f226-3de2-46df-b634-c2f6c0447267","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is used unconditionally to build the DOCTYPE string, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.816119180Z"}
{"id":"88e70d93-a2b4-4474-ae2c-43b85103ebdc","expr":"systemId != null","rationale":"In the method, systemId is appended without null guards, so it's expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.816119180Z"}
{"id":"9bf08e5d-8071-4a37-80c4-dd645748442a","expr":"(publicId == null) || (publicId.length() > 0)","rationale":"If publicId is provided, it is used meaningfully, so if not null, it is presumably non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.816119180Z"}
{"id":"043f5e9f-ddbf-4f96-95f6-dcd75495d6f6","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"As 'name' is used in constructing DOCTYPE, it should have a positive length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.816119180Z"}
{"id":"77ebc7bd-6498-42b1-9234-76fc0fe64542","expr":"systemId.length() > 0","rationale":"The systemId string is appended directly; presumably it's non-empty for a valid DOCTYPE.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.816119180Z"}
{"id":"df475c1b-c65d-4a02-839e-19005c58b4a0","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0","rationale":"Based on the method appending name to the DOCTYPE, name must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.821988687Z"}
{"id":"ee06bf1d-e455-4b49-a525-c0779aafdb9f","expr":"(publicId != null) || (systemId != null && systemId.length() > 0)","rationale":"SystemId is appended either after 'PUBLIC' if publicId is present or after 'SYSTEM' otherwise, implying systemId is always non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.821988687Z"}
{"id":"e7627116-5abc-4c37-ace3-9c0100a17654","expr":"systemId != null && systemId.length() > 0","rationale":"The method appends systemId in both branches implying systemId must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.821988687Z"}
{"id":"775cd4e6-5422-4b10-aa35-93afeb381efd","expr":"publicId == null || (publicId.length() > 0)","rationale":"The code appends 'PUBLIC \"' + publicId + '\" \"', so if publicId is not null, it likely is non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.821988687Z"}
{"id":"7748d818-cc4b-4bf1-a287-9cdb9ba502b1","expr":"!(publicId != null && systemId == null)","rationale":"When publicId is non-null, systemId must also be non-null to produce a well-formed DOCTYPE declaration.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.821988687Z"}
{"id":"d101f900-b874-4d59-9af8-d946fae10ea0","expr":"ch != null  &&  start >= 0  &&  length >= 0  &&  start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The constructor new String(char[] value, int offset, int count) requires that offset and count specify a valid range within the array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.858512791Z"}
{"id":"f4cdf051-6db9-4577-948b-ac747f5d1a0c","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"Length describes how many characters from ch starting at start are used. Negative length would be invalid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.858512791Z"}
{"id":"73ac1721-3259-41ec-bcdf-45f987723cf8","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"Java array indexing requires start index to be at least 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.858512791Z"}
{"id":"647f7a3f-1e95-4d98-95dd-9b72dd153cd1","expr":"start <= ch.length","rationale":"Start index must be within or at most equal to ch length to avoid IndexOutOfBounds.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.858512791Z"}
{"id":"f232cb9b-96cc-40a5-a9d8-3ea564eddc47","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"Creating a new String with the given char array requires that the array is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.864450286Z"}
{"id":"7dc11575-79e5-4454-b99b-acc185bfa499","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"The start index for substring extraction must be within valid array bounds, starting from zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.864450286Z"}
{"id":"a9f7760d-104c-4274-9cf3-50749bf866da","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"Length passed to String constructor must be non-negative to avoid exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.864450286Z"}
{"id":"9cfc77aa-ecdb-44cb-abf8-0afff80c110e","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The substring defined by start and length must fit entirely within the bounds of the char array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.864450286Z"}
{"id":"0824e10f-8c5e-4d80-b980-573aa067759a","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method logically expects 'name' parameter to identify the entity starting.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.875097831Z"}
{"id":"552584a8-ac89-4617-ad6e-b4fbe0a4bf57","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Entity names should generally be non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.875097831Z"}
{"id":"a12209ef-d145-4ced-818c-19c877fb79ff","expr":"name.trim().length() == name.length()","rationale":"Leading or trailing spaces in name are generally disallowed or unintended.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.875097831Z"}
{"id":"a3c6f9af-248e-45fb-9fbc-d9f8040b829d","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter should be non-null after the method starts processing an entity.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.875874856Z"}
{"id":"ec52d2e4-c546-4bee-89b2-98e004763e56","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name parameter represents the entity name to end; it is expected to be non-null to identify the entity.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.887864342Z"}
{"id":"112e0e96-ee21-456e-9399-d157c0704365","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"An entity name having length greater than zero makes sense semantically for XML entity naming.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.887864342Z"}
{"id":"5d386347-7609-49bd-ac3e-ad033aab33da","expr":"!name.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Entity names in XML do not generally contain whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.887864342Z"}
{"id":"f399fc48-9480-4174-bbf0-e5e7717741d8","expr":"name.equals(name.trim())","rationale":"It is expected that entity names are trimmed and do not have excess whitespace around.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:13.887864342Z"}
{"id":"a2ec317d-08c4-4ea6-b682-b515a777ce8b","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.length() >= 0","rationale":"prefix is either null or a string of length at least zero","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#removeBinding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.060413372Z"}
{"id":"488f713f-4c98-49ff-8c8f-a165ce024be3","expr":"prefix == null || !prefix.isEmpty()","rationale":"In the use case, prefix being empty is allowed as default prefix, otherwise non-empty string is possible","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#removeBinding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.060413372Z"}
{"id":"811bd4c5-f419-4f16-873b-308a661da853","expr":"prefix == null || prefix != null","rationale":"This clarifies prefix can be null or not null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#removeBinding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.060413372Z"}
{"id":"eb573748-228a-4d6d-9d0f-006f15c776fc","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.indexOf(\":\") == -1","rationale":"Namespace prefixes are usually simple strings without colon characters","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#removeBinding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.060413372Z"}
{"id":"0c0decf9-c9ec-400c-af11-6c8d7bfa4ad9","expr":"qName != null","rationale":"Parameter qName should be non-null to access its methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.074711781Z"}
{"id":"28818cc2-1ce5-49e8-a880-4aec22801e4d","expr":"qName.getPrefix() != null","rationale":"Prefix string should be non-null to allow empty check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.074711781Z"}
{"id":"7e5a1641-b15b-42f4-a90f-903317fe351c","expr":"qName.getLocalPart() != null","rationale":"LocalPart string should be non-null to allow equality check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.074711781Z"}
{"id":"5094b170-365d-4abb-b35a-0fdd56ff7164","expr":"qName.getLocalPart().length() >= 0","rationale":"Strings returned by getLocalPart have non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.074711781Z"}
{"id":"da508569-e938-4dd0-baf7-1fbbaeeaccd8","expr":"!result || (qName.getPrefix().isEmpty() || !qName.getLocalPart().isEmpty())","rationale":"If the QName is declared as a namespace, then prefix is empty or localPart not empty holds.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.088254394Z"}
{"id":"2e5f9479-71d7-443a-a637-6195290c613d","expr":"!result || (qName.getLocalPart() != null && qName.getPrefix() != null)","rationale":"If result is true, both qName fields must be non-null to safely evaluate their equality to \"xmlns\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.088254394Z"}
{"id":"301de2cb-8f63-471f-b8ca-585e5055b01e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a map from the last element of a non-empty list, which is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#currentNamespaceMapping():Map<String, String>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.111810578Z"}
{"id":"188ffd9c-a05c-4147-84c2-db6244fd4c4f","expr":"contentHandler == null || contentHandler.getClass().getMethods().length > 0","rationale":"If contentHandler is not null, it should be a real content handler with methods defined (heuristic)","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#setContentHandler(ContentHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.184624454Z"}
{"id":"9462a0ac-c19e-45c3-8d05-f8b4fe444390","expr":"contentHandler == null || contentHandler.getClass() != null","rationale":"If contentHandler is not null, it must have a non-null class object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#setContentHandler(ContentHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.191192878Z"}
{"id":"e1656da8-5895-4d18-b817-3fc4f9a4e996","expr":"result == null || result.getClass() != null","rationale":"If result is not null, it must be a valid instance of ContentHandler (which must have a class).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#getContentHandler():ContentHandler","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:14.200016665Z"}
{"id":"6cd78233-8fd2-42ba-a77f-187d46b056fa","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an iterator over a keySet, so the result must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#getBoundPrefixes():Iterator<String>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:15.447356026Z"}
{"id":"62f8c2db-e469-40ad-9285-82d279571fe6","expr":"!result.hasNext() || result.next() != null","rationale":"If the iterator has elements, the next element should be a non-null String prefix.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#getBoundPrefixes():Iterator<String>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:15.447356026Z"}
{"id":"87a1bf6e-78f7-45a8-86ae-730e3b6d819c","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Because the method calls name.startsWith, name must be non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#getFeature(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:16.808200743Z"}
{"id":"18ce131a-a1b3-4579-a8c6-636c0b6545b2","expr":"qualifiedName != null","rationale":"Qualified names must be provided and non-null as per method design.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:17.184405073Z"}
{"id":"352ebc6c-66f6-447e-9f93-ab18e17deac6","expr":"qualifiedName.indexOf(':') >= -1","rationale":"The indexOf method returns -1 if ':' is not found or the index of ':' otherwise.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:17.184405073Z"}
