{"id":"eabbb500-2981-4d7e-8840-6b2c1404c09e","expr":"namespaceUri != null || (namespaceUri == null)","rationale":"Namespace URI may be null, and it is handled in QName creation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:17.184405073Z"}
{"id":"07845f50-03c4-4fe4-bbcd-a506c38a3b14","expr":"qualifiedName.length() >= 0","rationale":"The length of qualifiedName is non-negative by definition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:17.184405073Z"}
{"id":"d5e26b8d-09a2-4e38-ab02-46850bfd3e5b","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method compares name to a fixed string, so name is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#getProperty(String):Object","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:18.602084318Z"}
{"id":"df4bb2cd-8a56-4f71-9e97-1c8aa5ab6ff3","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method calls name.startsWith, so name must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#setFeature(String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:19.056592876Z"}
{"id":"292463b1-16e2-495b-849a-17016315fde7","expr":"!value","rationale":"If value was true and name started with the prefix, method would throw, so value must be false on exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#setFeature(String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:19.218892221Z"}
