{"id":"99862c77-b428-43aa-a3f1-6cb8aa15b96e","expr":"ex != null","rationale":"The warning method uses ex to log the warning, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleTransformErrorListener#warning(TransformerException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleTransformErrorListener.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:19.536612933Z"}
{"id":"e71d7d14-171d-44f4-b1fc-b10eda2415af","expr":"ex.getMessage() != null || ex.getCause() != null","rationale":"A TransformerException usually holds some message or cause information when a warning is logged.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleTransformErrorListener#warning(TransformerException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleTransformErrorListener.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:19.536612933Z"}
{"id":"12b827f9-ae8b-4646-9d7b-9c3bc698740a","expr":"ex.getLocator() == null || ex.getLocator() != null","rationale":"The locator may or may not be null; this invariant is always true but included to stress no error is thrown while accessing getLocator.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleTransformErrorListener#warning(TransformerException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleTransformErrorListener.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:19.536612933Z"}
{"id":"1e66e984-511e-4fee-878c-40b3620804c4","expr":"ex.getMessage() == null || !ex.getMessage().isEmpty()","rationale":"If there is a message, it should not be an empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleTransformErrorListener#warning(TransformerException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleTransformErrorListener.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:19.536612933Z"}
{"id":"48fbc261-a92c-4eac-a7a8-e457997231ab","expr":"ex != null","rationale":"The warning method expects a non-null TransformerException to log.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleTransformErrorListener#warning(TransformerException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleTransformErrorListener.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:19.538817650Z"}
{"id":"057c0c03-ee65-4b17-9f55-10b42b703037","expr":"ex.getMessage() != null","rationale":"It's reasonable to expect the exception to have a descriptive message.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleTransformErrorListener#warning(TransformerException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleTransformErrorListener.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:19.538817650Z"}
{"id":"a4500cdd-054f-4d13-80e2-75008b8bf912","expr":"result.getNamespaceURI() == namespaceUri","rationale":"The QName constructor is called with namespaceUri, so result's namespaceURI equals namespaceUri.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:19.541419606Z"}
{"id":"9baf7ded-381c-41db-83fd-fbf9ebe8967f","expr":"ex != null && ex.getMessage() != null && !ex.getMessage().isEmpty()","rationale":"The error method is called with a TransformerException, which typically contains a meaningful message.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleTransformErrorListener#error(TransformerException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleTransformErrorListener.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:19.541557747Z"}
{"id":"0992695e-4913-44e9-9cf7-a3ca8f77d6d4","expr":"qualifiedName.indexOf(':') == -1 || result.getLocalPart().equals(qualifiedName.substring(qualifiedName.indexOf(':') + 1))","rationale":"If qualifiedName contains ':', result local part is substring after the colon.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:39:19.541419606Z"}
