{"id":"e1f719db-5bca-4dc6-ab9b-8ccad80ca716","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"The search loops over superclasses and returns a method from a superclass of the declaringClass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:06.506560916Z"}
{"id":"b308461d-8155-4a85-a4f0-4b15744285ff","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method is designed to return a Method object, either the original or a corresponding interface method, so 'result' should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:07.457110027Z"}
