{"id":"1d676fa9-b7c3-4db4-a4e9-d1dbaacfb515","expr":"result.isPublic()","rationale":"The interface method returned should be publicly accessible given the method's purpose in reflection and module system compatibility.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:07.457110027Z"}
{"id":"628a8fb1-1532-4ed5-8a7b-e52aaacf2c41","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Method returns either the given method or a corresponding interface method, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:07.848515981Z"}
