{"id":"2b99c99a-4620-4dbd-b09d-cf13186cea52","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter must be non-null to identify the method to find an interface method for.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:08.253798821Z"}
{"id":"0838fa09-f21d-476e-9dfe-e29a3cc3b76e","expr":"targetClass == null || targetClass.isAssignableFrom(method.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"If targetClass is provided, it must be in the same type hierarchy or the same class as the method's declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:08.253798821Z"}
