{"id":"a391a522-7dff-4d30-b6d9-38ee939b20d7","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"The number of parameters is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:09.011337967Z"}
{"id":"10a24efe-eb04-4b00-ae59-7c84e9142792","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null Method instance, either the input method or a publicly accessible equivalent.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:10.809605570Z"}
