{"id":"6f45920e-07cc-4163-94ce-3c1d81872f5d","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter is asserted to be not null as per the code.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isUserLevelMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.170022766Z"}
