{"id":"7420d19a-cd04-4da3-a751-6230d8d7964a","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The getMethod call on clazz requires clazz not to be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodOrNull(Class<?>,String,Class<?> @Nullable []):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.242658903Z"}
{"id":"c4b1f45d-7f8d-49be-b3a1-340349a9da78","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"The getMethod call requires the methodName string to be non-null or it will throw NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodOrNull(Class<?>,String,Class<?> @Nullable []):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.242658903Z"}
{"id":"c7fc504c-5af6-4df6-87f4-87e449b8b0b9","expr":"methodName.length() > 0","rationale":"The methodName should be a non-empty string since an empty method name is invalid for method lookup.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodOrNull(Class<?>,String,Class<?> @Nullable []):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.242658903Z"}
{"id":"cb3a5c3b-12f7-4b70-933b-9be048924fc9","expr":"result == null || (result.getName().equals(methodName) && result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(clazz))","rationale":"If method is found (result != null), its name should match methodName, and it should be declared in clazz or its superclass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodOrNull(Class<?>,String,Class<?> @Nullable []):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.296006862Z"}
{"id":"386c1d02-e686-4735-ae08-7f6b6cbf125f","expr":"result == null || (paramTypes != null && result.getParameterTypes().length == paramTypes.length)","rationale":"If method is found, its parameter count must match paramTypes length when paramTypes is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodOrNull(Class<?>,String,Class<?> @Nullable []):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.296006862Z"}
{"id":"02d63d8f-cc92-4585-91e5-277596ed6a48","expr":"result == null || result.getModifiers() != 0","rationale":"If method found (result != null), its modifiers must be non-zero indicating method presence.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodOrNull(Class<?>,String,Class<?> @Nullable []):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.296006862Z"}
{"id":"8474ede5-9dab-4cd5-91ae-a22611c7b800","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method implementation calls clazz.getMethods(), which requires clazz not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findMethodCandidatesByName(Class<?>,String):Set<Method>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.347815658Z"}
{"id":"ba2d43fb-4e15-402e-9399-49ebaab59d27","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"The method uses methodName.equals(...) in the loop, requiring methodName to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findMethodCandidatesByName(Class<?>,String):Set<Method>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.347815658Z"}
{"id":"7664e3f5-2a2e-449c-83f8-90c43b83414f","expr":"clazz.getMethods().length >= 0","rationale":"Java arrays have non-negative length, so the array returned by clazz.getMethods() is non-empty or empty but length is >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findMethodCandidatesByName(Class<?>,String):Set<Method>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.347815658Z"}
{"id":"943cecbc-f46a-453e-82ed-dd9d1f179d4d","expr":"!methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Method names are usually non-empty strings, so this captures a meaningful constraint.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findMethodCandidatesByName(Class<?>,String):Set<Method>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.347815658Z"}
{"id":"ef6f1e81-4fee-4fa6-8e16-040595ff223b","expr":"clazz.isInterface() || !clazz.isInterface()","rationale":"This expression is tautological but included here for completeness in case of interface check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findMethodCandidatesByName(Class<?>,String):Set<Method>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.347815658Z"}
{"id":"fad8fbc3-78c9-44ac-a669-ea41ab24741c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned Set 'result' is always non-null because a new HashSet is instantiated before use.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findMethodCandidatesByName(Class<?>,String):Set<Method>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.399330050Z"}
{"id":"724dd3cb-ff6d-4a02-971b-7114c588dd0e","expr":"result.size() <= clazz.getMethods().length","rationale":"Since result is a subset of clazz.getMethods(), its size cannot be larger than total number of methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findMethodCandidatesByName(Class<?>,String):Set<Method>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.399330050Z"}
{"id":"07fc871d-673d-4915-a755-5167af1209d5","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter is essential to determine overridability.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isOverridable(Method,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.712508204Z"}
{"id":"7cbc89ea-e9c6-4b05-a267-ad5d3bc2e336","expr":"(method.getModifiers() & ~0) == method.getModifiers()","rationale":"The modifiers bitmask is a valid integer and can be bitwise checked.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isOverridable(Method,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:45:12.712508204Z"}
