{"id":"0c94819f-5acd-45fb-a719-5cbe1f54a90d","expr":"!result || annotationName.length() > 0","rationale":"If there exist annotated methods, then the annotationName must be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.type.AnnotationMetadata#hasAnnotatedMethods(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/type/AnnotationMetadata.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.022425183Z"}
