{"id":"d74f8ec8-a8a6-42fd-8018-7c0055e29c71","expr":"buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"buffer length is always non-negative before appending","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.476556928Z"}
{"id":"38defd59-e508-4c88-ac80-2b86b83eb3b3","expr":"buffer.toString().indexOf('@') == -1","rationale":"Method appends '@'; prior to call this character should not already exist in buffer","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.476556928Z"}
{"id":"3dc89526-9621-402e-a575-4e4a96e24cc8","expr":"buffer.toString().equals(buffer.toString())","rationale":"To be excluded because this is a tautology, added here for reference","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.476556928Z"}
{"id":"29bb3bdc-06b7-4d24-b9c2-a0e29af6f618","expr":"buffer.length() > 0","rationale":"After appending '@' and the identity hex string, the buffer must have increased in length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.483756904Z"}
{"id":"b2d279fe-b88b-4193-aa97-0d386c1273b3","expr":"buffer.indexOf(\"@\") >= 0","rationale":"The character '@' is always appended to buffer, so it should be present.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.483756904Z"}
{"id":"1b658166-44d4-4cf0-a63c-ae8eb6a914be","expr":"obj != null || buffer.indexOf(\"null\") >= 0","rationale":"If obj is null, ObjectUtils.getIdentityHexString(obj) returns \"null\" string appended to buffer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.483756904Z"}
{"id":"8123d68c-95e2-4621-a309-b1ec4a432842","expr":"!buffer.toString().endsWith(\"@\")","rationale":"The buffer ends with the identity string, not just '@'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.483756904Z"}
{"id":"9c1209f7-6981-4a2a-a06c-a7031056c3b3","expr":"className != null","rationale":"The method documentation indicates className must be provided for resolution","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.ConfigurableObjectInputStream#resolveFallbackIfPossible(String,ClassNotFoundException):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/core/ConfigurableObjectInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.487660924Z"}
{"id":"d4a73047-ef08-4338-9cc5-b542599e9624","expr":"ex != null","rationale":"The method must rethrow the provided ClassNotFoundException, implying ex is non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.ConfigurableObjectInputStream#resolveFallbackIfPossible(String,ClassNotFoundException):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/core/ConfigurableObjectInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.487660924Z"}
{"id":"1b4d9c3e-0ee6-4684-ba11-5c8f65887130","expr":"className.length() > 0","rationale":"Resolving an empty class name would be invalid","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.ConfigurableObjectInputStream#resolveFallbackIfPossible(String,ClassNotFoundException):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/core/ConfigurableObjectInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.487660924Z"}
{"id":"1d957b95-edaa-48c8-9af4-8cb3bd7fd7a6","expr":"!className.isEmpty()","rationale":"ensures className is a meaningful string","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.ConfigurableObjectInputStream#resolveFallbackIfPossible(String,ClassNotFoundException):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/core/ConfigurableObjectInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.487660924Z"}
{"id":"e7d7b5dd-5a78-42f7-b901-9d1834868b4d","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"The method immediately calls buffer.append, so buffer must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.490557275Z"}
{"id":"64218d71-a8da-4711-95ed-6a76981e9d5a","expr":"buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"StringBuilder length is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.490557275Z"}
{"id":"63a4bea8-8eb2-42e9-aebe-9af41812b958","expr":"o == null || true","rationale":"The parameter o is passed but the method implementation does not read or depend on it, so its state doesn't constrain the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.490557275Z"}
{"id":"878c0efa-63ae-4b56-8c21-5c85b96252a6","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"The method invokes buffer.append, so buffer must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.494555814Z"}
{"id":"fa487841-0c22-43f3-a5af-feb5b3e7e1a5","expr":"buffer.length() > 0","rationale":"Since the method appends a character ']', the buffer length is increased, so it should be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.494555814Z"}
{"id":"f85d3290-6f53-46b9-b32d-764e57167c4a","expr":"buffer.charAt(buffer.length() - 1) == ']'","rationale":"The method appends ']' at the end, so the last character in buffer should be ']'","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.494555814Z"}
{"id":"0fba5dc6-cfab-4095-97ba-71342d9544fa","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"The buffer is used for appending strings in styleFieldStart and styleValue, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.497888117Z"}
{"id":"73463e59-1a7c-4d46-bd0a-8c44b64e2b77","expr":"fieldName != null","rationale":"The fieldName string is used to identify the field being styled and usually should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.497888117Z"}
{"id":"078419a1-65ab-4fdf-9ac5-519b4efa9a05","expr":"fieldName.length() > 0","rationale":"A non-empty fieldName is expected to meaningfully style the field name in the output.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.497888117Z"}
{"id":"a3cdb534-21cf-45ed-bee5-3113e5c16f1a","expr":"(value == null) || (value.toString() != null)","rationale":"If the value is non-null, its toString must be non-null to be styled correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.497888117Z"}
{"id":"b87a999f-4f53-4b17-b22f-44a992a527e6","expr":"buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"The buffer length is always non-negative as a property of StringBuilder.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.497888117Z"}
{"id":"e371e89d-3018-4290-b6ca-2356c1904cf1","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"buffer must be non-null since it is used for appending in styleField methods","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.501691428Z"}
{"id":"b37f977b-f1ab-4923-b025-948d368c6bd9","expr":"fieldName != null","rationale":"fieldName is expected to be non-null since styled as field identifier","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.501691428Z"}
{"id":"3a5862d2-572d-45b8-bd40-999f5275417f","expr":"buffer.length() > 0","rationale":"buffer should have content after styling field name and value","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.501691428Z"}
{"id":"f417147a-4358-4263-8e6b-b6c0677b6eec","expr":"value == null || buffer.toString().contains(value.toString())","rationale":"The buffer represents the field styling including the toString of the value when non-null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.501691428Z"}
{"id":"a80ce2c5-3043-48c5-838e-9e8e0cfd8325","expr":"!buffer.toString().contains(fieldName) || fieldName.length() == 0","rationale":"buffer includes fieldName after styleFieldStart and styleFieldEnd invocations","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.501691428Z"}
{"id":"319b4d42-0659-4988-aae2-5e197ebcde15","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"The method calls append() on buffer, so buffer must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldStart(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.505084595Z"}
{"id":"94b10526-35b9-4ea6-835f-1c81ea38fbbd","expr":"fieldName != null","rationale":"To safely call StringBuilder.append(fieldName) and produce meaningful output, fieldName is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldStart(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.505084595Z"}
{"id":"1e6372e7-983b-4893-af00-427fece82f35","expr":"fieldName.length() > 0","rationale":"For styleFieldStart to append a meaningful field name, fieldName should be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldStart(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.505084595Z"}
{"id":"5a6f1a50-49e2-434e-81cf-49c3f2879e29","expr":"buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"StringBuilder length is always >= 0; useful as a basic invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldStart(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.505084595Z"}
{"id":"0588289d-aef9-4cd2-8703-d5dde39cf56c","expr":"buffer.length() >= fieldName.length() + 3","rationale":"The buffer length must have increased by at least the length of the fieldName plus 3 characters (space, ' = ', and fieldName itself).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldStart(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.509064660Z"}
{"id":"0bd6a459-1141-4e7f-911a-59f7873c767b","expr":"fieldName != null && !fieldName.isEmpty()","rationale":"To produce a meaningful styled field start, fieldName should be non-null and not empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldStart(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.509064660Z"}
{"id":"97a2396f-d80d-4b7c-8798-e79980de7078","expr":"buffer.charAt(buffer.length() - fieldName.length() - 3) == ' '","rationale":"The character before the fieldName in buffer is a space character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldStart(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.509064660Z"}
{"id":"738e335b-1f8b-4388-9605-d2d5ec72d5bb","expr":"buffer != null || fieldName != null","rationale":"Buffer or fieldName might be null but at least one is expected to be not null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldEnd(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.512386904Z"}
{"id":"a9cb2d19-5ca3-435a-b7d4-56d228255efb","expr":"buffer == null || buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"The length of the buffer, if it exists, cannot be negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldEnd(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:06.512386904Z"}
