{"id":"78e28e67-45f3-4e1a-a389-5d7f2ce29c5b","expr":"str.length() >= 0","rationale":"The length of str is always non-negative as guaranteed by String contract.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.112778030Z"}
{"id":"a0d04ad1-5224-467e-9a7f-91665aa3d6c5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a quoted version of the input string, result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.132204717Z"}
{"id":"22d232f3-a4ff-4b2c-ae2c-2a0df1eabf86","expr":"result.startsWith(\"\\\"\")","rationale":"The method prepends a quote character to the input string before returning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.132204717Z"}
{"id":"1a7805b8-3c85-45a8-aace-fd5c180b4464","expr":"result.endsWith(\"\\\"\")","rationale":"The method appends a quote character to the input string before returning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.132204717Z"}
{"id":"96129576-9362-4db0-9b3e-e7d7d4ad465e","expr":"result.length() == str.length() + 2","rationale":"The output string encloses the input string with one quote character at the start and one at the end.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.132204717Z"}
{"id":"51fbda25-0847-4949-89d0-000c247d52b8","expr":"result.substring(1, result.length() - 1).equals(str)","rationale":"The method builds the result by adding quotes around str, so str must be the substring excluding the surrounding quotes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.132204717Z"}
{"id":"2bddc11b-1032-404f-9db4-89ceb8cd68a4","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method is likely expected to be called with a non-null Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.140772471Z"}
{"id":"375960a2-3b71-408f-963e-2189b8ddd8d5","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"Typically, styleClass methods process reference classes, not primitives.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.140772471Z"}
{"id":"828cbe1d-9260-4f00-857b-2fcaba3d7ee0","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"A Class object's getName() must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.140772471Z"}
{"id":"7131648f-6f04-46db-a4d1-0537deab0acb","expr":"!clazz.isArray() || clazz.getComponentType() != null","rationale":"If clazz represents an array type, its component type must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.140772471Z"}
{"id":"e15c2ec7-2943-4537-98ee-8789df6123df","expr":"clazz.getSimpleName() != null","rationale":"The simple name of the class should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.140772471Z"}
{"id":"172c559b-9d4a-4328-b86e-bf146386e673","expr":"clazz != null && result != null && result.equals(clazz.getSimpleName()) || result.equals(clazz.getName()) || result.equals(clazz.toString()) || true","rationale":"Given styleClass returns a styled String of clazz, result is related to clazz's name or string representation","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.195000725Z"}
{"id":"6d5d7759-bf53-4c9b-a6a0-fe540329aeb7","expr":"result != null && result.length() > 0","rationale":"If result is non-null, it should be a non-empty string","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.195000725Z"}
{"id":"8fc367fd-af5c-49b1-8770-792559f68ca2","expr":"clazz != null || result == null","rationale":"If clazz is null, result may be null but not vice versa","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.195000725Z"}
{"id":"75f04ef9-c404-46a6-9a58-de3fc4f17f94","expr":"result != null && result.indexOf(' ') < 0","rationale":"Result string usually has no spaces since class names don't contain spaces","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.195000725Z"}
{"id":"121f098a-2a01-4357-b031-30772c277bbb","expr":"clazz != null && clazz.isPrimitive() == (result.length() <= 8)","rationale":"The length of the returned string may be small if the class is primitive; this is a heuristic","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.195000725Z"}
{"id":"67094aa1-811f-4499-b471-7999d47277e7","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter must be non-null to safely call methodStyler.apply(method) without NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.203545967Z"}
{"id":"55236bdf-325a-4e84-aff2-6360feb39e5d","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"A Method object always has an associated declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.203545967Z"}
{"id":"2bb9f4c1-2337-4712-90d9-814d2d49cf25","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method.getName() returns the method's name string, which is never null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.203545967Z"}
{"id":"986811fe-5b8e-4ba8-9ce3-0253d336e389","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Java Method objects always have zero or more parameters, never negative count.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.203545967Z"}
{"id":"e414f5c3-6ec7-40a8-9e10-49b566b5ca02","expr":"method.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"Every Method has a return Type object associated with it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.203545967Z"}
{"id":"3b10397b-ab8b-44e5-836d-03bb83d37684","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned string result should never be null, as it is the value of methodStyler.apply(method).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.212008933Z"}
{"id":"e77887b7-e511-4914-960c-709a347bba64","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"The styling of the method usually produces a non-empty string representing the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.212008933Z"}
{"id":"ca679a85-b788-4c87-8a11-ceb57cc6d8b4","expr":"result.contains(method.getName())","rationale":"The styled string typically includes the method's name to identify it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.212008933Z"}
{"id":"7699bfe2-615c-4592-a258-40fd224888ec","expr":"result.length() > 0 && method.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Both the method's name and the styled string are expected to be non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.212008933Z"}
{"id":"cb1ed58a-6ae3-410e-b28f-0ef67094833a","expr":"map != null","rationale":"The map parameter must be non-null for the method to execute correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.220455909Z"}
{"id":"5c690540-70ff-49ab-9e68-7f65869bc499","expr":"map.size() >= 0","rationale":"The size of the map cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.220455909Z"}
{"id":"e2088dad-5e9a-485a-8086-ff2a89d8a0b0","expr":"map.entrySet() != null","rationale":"map.entrySet() always returns a non-null set of entries.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.220455909Z"}
{"id":"f44c05bb-8455-486d-b4be-eeddbd0ff514","expr":"(map.isEmpty() && map.size() == 0) || (!map.isEmpty() && map.size() > 0)","rationale":"Emptiness of the map correlates correctly with its size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.220455909Z"}
{"id":"9a123a0c-71f5-4e97-89bb-f0559e23a95c","expr":"map == null || (result.length() >= 2)","rationale":"If map is not null, the minimal string is '{}', length 2.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.228827683Z"}
{"id":"e01827ff-d8a1-4b83-9df0-118ee2fe04ee","expr":"result != null","rationale":"StringJoiner.toString() returns a string with the formatted content, not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.228827683Z"}
{"id":"237da660-0438-4697-a238-50fc0bc2dcc5","expr":"collection != null","rationale":"The method iterates over collection, so it must not be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.237064984Z"}
{"id":"3a4a4966-bae6-4d90-aed2-66d69066d8de","expr":"collection.size() >= 0","rationale":"Collection size is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.237064984Z"}
{"id":"813ac33b-4010-4dcf-86d2-5f3f04d07742","expr":"collection.isEmpty() == (collection.size() == 0)","rationale":"isEmpty() is true iff size() == 0 by specification.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.237064984Z"}
{"id":"e6968b1a-53ac-48c4-a347-73b10189a657","expr":"result.startsWith(\"[\") && result.endsWith(\"]\")","rationale":"The method uses StringJoiner with '[' and ']' which guarantees these characters will wrap the string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.245608393Z"}
{"id":"2dd2d942-a801-453f-ad72-e46d1990ac46","expr":"result.equals(\"[]\") || collection.size() > 0","rationale":"An empty collection yields '[]', non-empty collection result is different from '[]'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.245608393Z"}
{"id":"9c01ace7-6da1-4808-acab-90aa09ada62e","expr":"!result.equals(\"[]\") || collection.isEmpty()","rationale":"The result equals '[]' if and only if the collection is empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.245608393Z"}
{"id":"ed8e71a9-04e4-42b4-8890-81ec4fce7988","expr":"result.length() >= 2","rationale":"The string always contains the opening and closing brackets, so minimum length is 2.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.245608393Z"}
{"id":"4ac12d7e-e17e-47f8-8a6c-04e493f8595f","expr":"result.contains(\",\") == (collection.size() > 1)","rationale":"The StringJoiner adds ', ' between elements, so commas appear if collection has more than one element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.245608393Z"}
{"id":"21cee0fc-c5eb-45f6-b476-e24c8284a135","expr":"array != null","rationale":"The method iterates over the array, so the input array must not be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.254060899Z"}
{"id":"660f671c-2d7b-4f98-aff1-0e07885e6ed7","expr":"array.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length in Java is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.254060899Z"}
{"id":"d1569191-240d-4672-95e8-eb65bb1efe86","expr":"result.startsWith(\"[\") && result.endsWith(\"]\")","rationale":"The result string represents the styled array enclosed in square brackets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.262907739Z"}
{"id":"d272fe48-fb6a-48c8-b63e-ef4e19da6bc5","expr":"(array.length == 0 && result.equals(\"[]\")) || (array.length > 0 && !result.equals(\"[]\"))","rationale":"The result is \"[]\" only when the array is empty; otherwise, it contains at least one element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.262907739Z"}
{"id":"ef3f8a64-965c-4bb3-b129-752acbcbe258","expr":"result.length() >= 2","rationale":"The result string always has at least the opening and closing brackets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.262907739Z"}
{"id":"efc8b206-8387-4c5a-b108-3332b106f7e6","expr":"!result.contains(\", ]\")","rationale":"The resulting string should not have a comma immediately before the closing bracket.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.262907739Z"}
{"id":"9137d20f-3e5e-44d0-a15d-376017ac7146","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter cannot be null to generate its signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.271712921Z"}
{"id":"51c0cc13-7522-4e9e-b5f0-5c61335b0941","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Java reflection guarantees getName() returns non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.271712921Z"}
{"id":"7c3559e6-9ff6-4824-96a8-28ae2d6e43a2","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"method.getParameterTypes() never returns null according to JDK spec.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.271712921Z"}
{"id":"3ce56606-ffd1-42a0-bc6f-e142a5104587","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.271712921Z"}
{"id":"5241d4d5-343b-4e0d-85e5-fa0a53d65f57","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The Java API guarantees that String.format returns a non-null String, so result is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.280638529Z"}
{"id":"7ccce3ba-514d-4b55-9173-4db9a7ecc693","expr":"result.startsWith(method.getName() + \"(\")","rationale":"The format string puts method name followed by '(' before the parameter list, so the result must start like that.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.280638529Z"}
{"id":"aff3f949-0280-4572-9446-937ac9d91ea5","expr":"result.endsWith(\")\")","rationale":"The String.format call appends a closing parenthesis at the end of the signature string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.280638529Z"}
{"id":"16196d5a-b8bd-407f-a98a-db5a82a61e0b","expr":"result.contains(\"(\") && result.indexOf('(') < result.indexOf(')')","rationale":"The signature syntax enforces an opening parenthesis that must appear before the closing parenthesis in the result string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.280638529Z"}
{"id":"4ca2d40e-48f7-4a44-964c-4d90554c90bd","expr":"out != null","rationale":"The store method requires a valid OutputStream to write to.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(OutputStream,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.290685432Z"}
{"id":"628148e5-1241-4bee-b72e-fd461777800a","expr":"comments == null || comments.length() >= 0","rationale":"If comments is provided, its length must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(OutputStream,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.290685432Z"}
{"id":"0703bc28-821a-4e5c-9649-a34be77ed6fd","expr":"out != null","rationale":"The method requires a non-null OutputStream to write properties.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(OutputStream,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.299943578Z"}
{"id":"d0cab5bd-2703-49bb-b8f2-15033001707d","expr":"writer != null","rationale":"The method writes to the provided writer, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(Writer,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.308961651Z"}
{"id":"6be6e574-6ae2-49fa-96e2-3a926ff34691","expr":"comments == null || !comments.isEmpty()","rationale":"Often comments are null or non-empty strings to be meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(Writer,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:48:19.308961651Z"}
