{"id":"c6e4e297-bc6e-4c8e-bfd1-6bfa69317926","expr":"!separator.equals(null)","rationale":"Reiterates the non-null nature of separator after the method sets it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#setSeparator(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:00.728136051Z"}
{"id":"334f2d6b-5b0f-4824-9317-d30784d8a4b7","expr":"separator == null || !separator.isEmpty()","rationale":"The separator if provided should be a non-empty string; empty separator is generally not useful as a delimiter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#setSeparator(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:02.614896422Z"}
{"id":"6acadc04-1730-49d7-a4cb-dcac98857e74","expr":"separator == null || separator.length() == 1","rationale":"Common separators in file names are single characters, so the passed separator may be expected to be a single character if non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#setSeparator(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:02.614896422Z"}
{"id":"35153dea-5e07-48c6-bc91-75d1fdf3416f","expr":"separator == null || !separator.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Separator strings usually do not include whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#setSeparator(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:02.614896422Z"}
{"id":"92fd33ca-fe87-4047-a987-e190c219e801","expr":"separator == null || separator != \"\"","rationale":"If non-null, separator should not be the empty string to function properly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#setSeparator(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:02.614896422Z"}
{"id":"5577f99b-f885-42b5-a7ac-65ebad73f7f0","expr":"properties != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null Properties object to set local properties.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:04.312867104Z"}
{"id":"5b767a6a-ce70-4d87-a76f-77ddfc2b20be","expr":"properties.isEmpty() || properties.size() >= 0","rationale":"The properties set can be empty or contain one or more entries.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:04.312867104Z"}
{"id":"6b91593e-da52-4755-8213-74046bc8b469","expr":"!properties.isEmpty() || properties.size() == 0","rationale":"If properties is empty, its size is zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:04.312867104Z"}
