{"id":"402f82bd-59fc-4ccd-9091-6774b659876f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method assigns result to a resource before returning, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#findLocalizedResource(String,String,Locale):Resource","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:04.974108933Z"}
{"id":"46ebe00d-aca9-45ca-a14f-3db606ddd292","expr":"properties != null","rationale":"The method assigns properties to a local array; to avoid null-related errors, properties is likely non-null at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:06.649780484Z"}
{"id":"4efdd1c9-8584-4824-a3c0-a9c4fb6d1ea7","expr":"properties.isEmpty() || properties.size() > 0","rationale":"properties represents a Properties object, which can be empty or have some keys; this is obvious but expresses their state.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:06.649780484Z"}
