{"id":"673197d8-fcf4-40be-a488-413d84c49f3f","expr":"propertiesArray != null","rationale":"Since this method sets the internal property array, propertiesArray should generally be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setPropertiesArray(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:06.844646319Z"}
