{"id":"0d86ca63-0d48-410e-a2fe-f73099167ab9","expr":"result.stringPropertyNames() != null","rationale":"The result Properties will always have a non-null key set, even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#mergeProperties():Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:18.354816095Z"}
{"id":"ffe9ae7a-cd30-4e94-a9e0-dea9cd4f058c","expr":"result.isEmpty() == (result.size() == 0)","rationale":"The isEmpty and size methods of Properties correspond consistently, so this expression always holds.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#mergeProperties():Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:18.354816095Z"}
{"id":"63110d1b-f582-40b4-b5e4-64d89175fa2a","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The method populates the given Properties object. It must be non-null for loadProperties to work.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#loadProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:21.096205196Z"}
