{"id":"6fa40cbf-8656-41e6-9e2d-3f86d375ab8f","expr":"(resource.getResource().getFilename() == null || !resource.getResource().getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\")) || resource.requiresReader() || resource.getInputStream() != null","rationale":"Depending on the filename and resource behavior, resource will provide the data through XML stream, reader, or input stream.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:27.537122994Z"}
