{"id":"9aec3f30-a161-4012-a9e6-7e31a2835a44","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The method loads properties into 'props', which must be non-null by contract.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:29.493363942Z"}
{"id":"6198e412-f7a3-41af-a91f-43dd29b3834b","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The method requires a resource to load from, so 'resource' is expected non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:29.493363942Z"}
{"id":"4d474b50-09f8-4bf5-829c-375c8f878bdb","expr":"persister != null","rationale":"The method calls persister to load properties, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:29.493363942Z"}
{"id":"220b6807-2081-49aa-94a5-6ad3d8524e81","expr":"(resource.getResource().getFilename() == null || !resource.getResource().getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\")) || props.size() > 0","rationale":"If the resource filename ends with .xml, then properties should be loaded and props is expected to be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:29.493363942Z"}
{"id":"19b0f1dd-63b1-4cea-95c0-3fc1733bfc8e","expr":"(resource.getResource().getFilename() != null && resource.getResource().getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\")) || (!resource.requiresReader() && props.size() >= 0)","rationale":"Regardless of the loading mechanism, props size is at least zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:29.493363942Z"}
{"id":"95b6fef3-6f30-4354-9ead-159f1727d171","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a new Properties object, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:30.879275584Z"}
{"id":"938856d8-f11d-49eb-be66-a7788e992c4b","expr":"result.isEmpty() || resource != null","rationale":"If properties are not empty, then the resource from which properties were loaded should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:30.879275584Z"}
{"id":"7daaec46-4671-46f4-a207-d385f5f18ea5","expr":"result.size() >= 0","rationale":"The size of the Properties object cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:30.879275584Z"}
{"id":"a6e11fb6-105c-4eb4-aebe-ff0a632ea0ff","expr":"resource == null || resource.exists() || result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If the resource is null or does not exist, the properties returned should be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:30.879275584Z"}
{"id":"f3ef093e-09dc-48c4-aeed-2668506918d9","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The resource parameter should not be null to be able to load properties from it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:31.139570579Z"}
{"id":"22babb04-8974-40b4-9c9e-baeb8330a96c","expr":"resource.exists()","rationale":"Loading properties from a non-existent resource would fail.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:31.139570579Z"}
{"id":"23a2ca0f-6d12-43df-b292-64dfcce93ab1","expr":"resource.isReadable()","rationale":"The resource must be readable to successfully load properties.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:31.139570579Z"}
{"id":"1e83782d-a1a9-44ca-a7dc-83560a1e9aa0","expr":"!resource.isOpen()","rationale":"Typically, resource should not be already open to ensure consistent loading.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:31.139570579Z"}
{"id":"65474036-133b-4476-982c-82f9937be094","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The properties object must be non-null to fill properties.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:32.682290478Z"}
{"id":"46b03bb4-fdb7-4568-bf82-7a0f3c38480e","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The resource from which the properties will be loaded must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:32.682290478Z"}
{"id":"51cd92ea-582f-49ba-9cc9-427c855573e3","expr":"resource.getInputStream() != null","rationale":"The input stream obtained from the resource must not be null to read properties.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:32.682290478Z"}
{"id":"ceac852f-193a-4d47-9869-6d0481e30850","expr":"resource.getFilename() != null","rationale":"Filename can be null but likely is non-null for resources with files.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:32.682290478Z"}
{"id":"55cdda75-e849-4ea4-b7a2-a91a5ac3ae2e","expr":"resource.getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\") || !resource.getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\")","rationale":"The filename either ends with XML extension or it does not, guiding load strategy.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:32.682290478Z"}
{"id":"644be4cf-aa50-4dee-b73a-bb9099731288","expr":"resourceName != null","rationale":"The resourceName is used to locate resources and generally should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:34.278706682Z"}
{"id":"e87fc4ab-435b-46bc-b580-9888490b7fe3","expr":"!resourceName.isEmpty()","rationale":"A valid non-empty string is expected as resourceName to specify a resource path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:34.278706682Z"}
{"id":"21fbcc2f-556d-4000-88d9-472bc420de06","expr":"resourceName.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"A resourceName that only contains whitespace is effectively invalid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:34.278706682Z"}
{"id":"4be31129-63ca-4c78-81c6-b05b5d1d2103","expr":"!resourceName.contains(\"\\\\\")","rationale":"Classpath resources generally use forward slashes, so backslash presence is invalid or unusual.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:34.278706682Z"}
{"id":"56d18500-7f89-47d7-b6ac-903d5989eb2d","expr":"resourceName.contains(\".\")","rationale":"resourceName is expected to specify a resource name often containing an extension.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:34.278706682Z"}
{"id":"42c19766-fbae-424e-9e09-9673a4635a65","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The method fills the given Properties instance, so it must be non-null at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:35.547198810Z"}
{"id":"fc7f13b6-1b0c-47bd-b6bb-231e65d91e73","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The load operation depends on a non-null resource, so resource should be non-null at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:35.547198810Z"}
{"id":"cfe2880a-b764-48ad-96cc-324de436a845","expr":"(resource.getFilename() == null) || (resource.getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\") == true) || (resource.getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\") == false)","rationale":"Filename suffix determines which load method was used; filename suffix must be coherent.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:35.547198810Z"}
{"id":"4dc08751-f630-4203-851c-2262a7b3520b","expr":"!resource.getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\") || props.size() > 0","rationale":"For XML resource files, the properties will have been loaded and props should contain entries.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:35.547198810Z"}
{"id":"a6545958-c588-401d-a9ae-1ec7fb59dc38","expr":"!(resource.getFilename() != null && resource.getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\") && props.size() == 0)","rationale":"If an XML file was loaded, props should not remain empty, reflecting successful loading.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:35.547198810Z"}
{"id":"5690e05c-f565-45a1-b603-442160ad3a4a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"According to the method Javadoc, it returns a populated Properties instance, so result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:36.241479484Z"}
{"id":"97ed0cb4-1a98-4221-ae45-e2295fb86365","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || resourceName == null","rationale":"If the resourceName is not null, the properties loaded should not be empty; if resourceName is null, result may be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:36.241479484Z"}
{"id":"81421d85-2708-46ba-91c8-0824e8745ac9","expr":"resourceName != null && !result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If the caller provided a non-null resourceName, it implies properties are loaded, thus result is not empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:36.241479484Z"}
{"id":"9c050b58-cf22-4a36-8c41-67cf7aed4f66","expr":"result.size() >= 0","rationale":"The size method of Properties always returns a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:36.241479484Z"}
{"id":"b4710e2e-710f-4c7e-83d1-bae1c5f2e1cd","expr":"resourceName != null","rationale":"Method asserts non-nullity of resourceName at start","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String,ClassLoader):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.473348171Z"}
{"id":"fbfcf610-a643-4bb7-b016-af752590e282","expr":"resourceName.length() > 0","rationale":"Resource name should be a non-empty string for loading resources","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String,ClassLoader):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.473348171Z"}
{"id":"d38e48a0-796e-4962-8419-8348f13b1e5c","expr":"resourceName.endsWith(\".properties\") || resourceName.endsWith(\".xml\") || !resourceName.endsWith(\".xml\")","rationale":"Resource name may end with .xml or .properties (others also allowed)","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String,ClassLoader):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.473348171Z"}
{"id":"9b996922-d109-4f63-b74e-742c44ff4410","expr":"!resourceName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Expressing non-empty via isEmpty method as alternative to length","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String,ClassLoader):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.473348171Z"}
{"id":"a711f49f-af72-4ddd-838a-6ad1db8fb46a","expr":"result == null || result.toString() != null","rationale":"Ensures that the result, if not null, has a non-null toString representation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getVisitorAttributes():Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.785612617Z"}
{"id":"5cc1cc95-7c6c-4bd0-b766-b088c738764b","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The resource object is likely non-null as the method attempts to obtain its path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.785996871Z"}
{"id":"3bdc73df-2ae5-4d9b-80be-6ba5ca4377cb","expr":"resource.getClass() != null","rationale":"The resource must belong to some class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.785996871Z"}
{"id":"9f6865f1-8a6f-4374-95e3-859669998476","expr":"url != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null URL to process.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.788511422Z"}
{"id":"594df24a-d434-43f5-92aa-261a05951c1e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns either a non-null path or an empty string, hence result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.788608355Z"}
{"id":"c89f121f-22b9-49d0-9786-ba4368590ddf","expr":"result.length() >= 0","rationale":"Result is a non-null String, so length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.788608355Z"}
{"id":"0c4c2d6a-5e6f-4ca0-afc6-f4caae57f8ad","expr":"url.getProtocol() != null","rationale":"The protocol must exist for the method to logically operate on the URL.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.788511422Z"}
{"id":"7ec3bec1-ec6d-4055-afdf-427d24d4f280","expr":"result != null && (result.equals(\"\") || !result.isEmpty())","rationale":"Covering possibility for meaningful non-empty path or empty string returned.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.788608355Z"}
{"id":"d3c4ba6a-ade5-4853-aa43-27fc7928e02a","expr":"url.getPath() != null","rationale":"The path component is essential to locate file system roots.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.788511422Z"}
{"id":"b6b89139-a500-477d-ac90-4b899aea89b6","expr":"url.getPath().startsWith(\"/\")","rationale":"Root paths usually start with a slash in standard URL formats.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.788511422Z"}
{"id":"c480039b-8888-4eab-85a2-6704723faa9f","expr":"url.getHost() == null || !url.getHost().isEmpty()","rationale":"A valid URL may have an empty or specified host, which might be relevant for root determination.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.788511422Z"}
{"id":"d81de667-e21e-451b-828b-141d32216f92","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The method likely operates on a non-null resource to invoke visit.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#visit(Object,InvocationHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.792297078Z"}
{"id":"b3f75b4a-735b-4627-a3f9-8f8f2805b979","expr":"visitor != null","rationale":"InvocationHandler 'visitor' is used to create a proxy, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#visit(Object,InvocationHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.792297078Z"}
{"id":"63c145fe-3c4d-4c4d-964d-430d43848b4d","expr":"visitor.getClass().isInterface() == false","rationale":"As visitor is an InvocationHandler, it is a concrete class, not an interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#visit(Object,InvocationHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.792297078Z"}
{"id":"c368188a-ebd8-49a4-8511-ecd567043252","expr":"resource.getClass().getClassLoader() != null || true","rationale":"This is trivial and likely always true for any loaded class, so omitted.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#visit(Object,InvocationHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.792297078Z"}
{"id":"635cbbac-ab79-4fe9-834a-ffaf68913dbd","expr":"url != null && url.equals(result)","rationale":"If the root is the same as the input URL, result equals url.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.792745002Z"}
{"id":"2b15a953-1fa1-4e6e-9836-6392663dfa18","expr":"url.toString().startsWith(result.toString())","rationale":"The root object's string form is expected to be a prefix path or prefix URL of the original URL.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.792745002Z"}
{"id":"26111abd-c3dc-4075-8d07-8f5a10ebfe3f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method should return a non-null root object whenever it completes successfully.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.792745002Z"}
{"id":"3ed8320d-c743-4f01-aca3-77d1235aea62","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The method invokes invokeVfsMethod with resource, so resource must be non-null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#visit(Object,InvocationHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.794805868Z"}
{"id":"c2d856d0-74cf-4a0b-8fa3-c522ff8306e3","expr":"visitor != null","rationale":"visitor is used to create a proxy, so it must be non-null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#visit(Object,InvocationHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:54:37.794805868Z"}
