{"id":"79140cb9-5571-44be-9e4f-64a053421453","expr":"key != null","rationale":"The method takes a String key and delegates to propertyResolver.containsProperty(key). Most property lookups require non-null keys.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractEnvironment#containsProperty(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractEnvironment.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:56:15.136456383Z"}
