{"id":"44eeaa1b-c345-440d-af3b-7158a46a3e87","expr":"names.length > 0","rationale":"Since getField uses names in a switch for retrieving fields, it is likely that names is expected to contain at least one element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.FieldProviderTransformer#getField(String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/FieldProviderTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.547357996Z"}
