{"id":"eb2662b0-8815-45af-9d3e-288bbea6b107","expr":"names.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.FieldProviderTransformer#setField(String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/FieldProviderTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.570046827Z"}
{"id":"5f6a71b4-21a0-404c-b4cb-d90d06da6315","expr":"names != null","rationale":"The array names must not be null since it is used for the string switch.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.FieldProviderTransformer#setField(String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/FieldProviderTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.570314502Z"}
{"id":"33a0abb3-6b9f-4ae5-aee8-988317a851d7","expr":"names.length > 0","rationale":"At the exit of setField, names likely contains one or more strings to identify fields.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.FieldProviderTransformer#setField(String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/FieldProviderTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.570314502Z"}
{"id":"f170734c-3776-4368-8335-329814a3ac83","expr":"className != null","rationale":"Since className is the name of the class being started, it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.589991233Z"}
