{"id":"28b493ca-d60e-410b-be33-09f15251653b","expr":"(interfaces.length >= 0)","rationale":"Interfaces array length is always zero or more.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.589991233Z"}
{"id":"e91cc025-eb2d-49f7-bbc7-47b0026fee52","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"The version number should be non-negative, as class file versions are defined as positive integer values.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.589991233Z"}
{"id":"fe5c68a6-3642-4198-a221-43458d7f2e03","expr":"superType != null","rationale":"Normally, every non-root class has a superclass type specified here.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.591037436Z"}
{"id":"cadaec42-50be-4d3c-8184-0e78f79c3881","expr":"className != null && !className.isEmpty()","rationale":"Class name is the identifier of the class and is not expected to be null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.591037436Z"}
{"id":"22b609fe-99f8-4950-89f1-f6512ea4764d","expr":"interfaces != null","rationale":"Interfaces array is always allocated even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.591037436Z"}
{"id":"fbc990f8-2775-41f4-bf04-3f92902fcafd","expr":"sourceFile == null || !sourceFile.isEmpty()","rationale":"Source file name is either null or a meaningful string, but not empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.591037436Z"}
{"id":"e6e73fc7-05b5-4e3e-8b06-354907f81fe1","expr":"version > 0","rationale":"Class file version is typically a positive integer representing the bytecode version.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.591037436Z"}
{"id":"71e9b35a-e9dd-451b-b0b9-9d672b2b92b2","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Field name should be non-null in declaration context.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#declare_field(int,String,Type,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.592036710Z"}
