{"id":"65bd6939-054a-4eb6-b1b0-98aff2e8b50e","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The code calls type.getDescriptor(), so the descriptor should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.600569929Z"}
{"id":"0a53625a-e69d-48fd-872e-a746b8f2db5c","expr":"type.getDescriptor().length() > 0","rationale":"The descriptor string should be non-empty to represent a valid type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.600569929Z"}
{"id":"aa80b891-0fda-48ec-bcb4-f86682a4c2b4","expr":"!(name.isEmpty())","rationale":"A read method name logically should not be the empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.600569929Z"}
{"id":"2c3e32b0-7926-46ed-8f05-9a0538454255","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method 'addReadMethod' adds a method related to a field named 'name', which should be a valid field name string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.601500704Z"}
{"id":"37d77498-ec7f-4717-8325-ec10325c86fe","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method uses 'type' to determine the descriptor and for generating the read method; it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.601500704Z"}
{"id":"231605f5-16b2-4a7f-88b3-6dde82b5da27","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The method calls 'type.getDescriptor()' to form the read method signature, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.601500704Z"}
{"id":"a6c57aba-7ca8-4ef6-ba20-03b1f163abc6","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The field name used for writing must be a non-null string to generate the corresponding method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610016521Z"}
{"id":"bcd778d1-7cfa-4502-bc64-1eab40c5cbf6","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The Type parameter is essential to define the method signature and generate code accordingly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610016521Z"}
{"id":"b0c70301-800a-4603-97da-13cfd1931113","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The method signature is derived from the type descriptor and hence must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610016521Z"}
{"id":"1f8f90c4-ec18-43a0-b44e-845023c0dc19","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"A zero-length name is unlikely to be valid for generating field write code.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610016521Z"}
{"id":"21c9d212-a097-493c-8058-8b9236b24b1e","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method is creating write methods for fields identified by non-null names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610357544Z"}
{"id":"d25abcf7-f119-47c4-95b7-bad27f53bf5b","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method is invoked with a Type instance representing the field's type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610357544Z"}
{"id":"81756472-45f7-4965-b18c-61ee3d7f5340","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The method uses type descriptor string to construct method signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610357544Z"}
{"id":"f0887ca6-66f9-44ec-bfeb-d2637241bb77","expr":"sig != null","rationale":"The 'sig' parameter represents the method signature; typically it should not be null because the method requires method signature metadata to proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610955762Z"}
{"id":"baecc57c-6772-4aa3-9690-c9a440380468","expr":"exceptions != null","rationale":"The 'exceptions' parameter holds the list of exception types the method might throw; usually this is non-null, although it might be an empty array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610955762Z"}
{"id":"18aa15cf-bc38-490c-b04a-d7080532ad4a","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"The 'access' integer represents method access flags and modifiers. These flags are bits in a non-negative integer mask, so this is expected to be >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610955762Z"}
{"id":"91b3c0a6-ee02-463b-aa6b-f83052f5184b","expr":"exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"'exceptions' is an array; its length is zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610955762Z"}
{"id":"48a6bb55-497a-4fb3-8f7f-56671c96b1c8","expr":"sig.getArgumentTypes() != null","rationale":"The Signature object usually provides non-null argument types array to represent the method's parameters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.610955762Z"}
{"id":"41df52fa-1d7a-4d03-807d-12a37078dca5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method constructs and returns a new CodeEmitter object wrapping the super begin_method call, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.619747048Z"}
{"id":"a3187858-eba1-4894-a46d-df74de53262e","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method concatenates name with a string; hence name should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.628873266Z"}
{"id":"cf595b89-a6a7-42d5-90f1-9c137fb77a02","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The method concatenates desc with another string forming a signature descriptor, so desc should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.628873266Z"}
{"id":"a77703c5-0b30-483c-8cc5-1b058c265a6d","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"A method name is normally not empty; concatenating with a prefix suggests name is a meaningful identifier.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.628873266Z"}
{"id":"55f57dca-d324-47eb-a340-4cf61f7b013d","expr":"desc.length() >= 0","rationale":"The descriptor string is passed into the signature and could be empty but never negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.628873266Z"}
{"id":"1c81d423-0cb1-489e-a383-7b9d85526341","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a new Signature instance thus result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.637058179Z"}
