{"id":"18fbbea8-6eae-40ca-a317-3e7ee324c504","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor encodes the method's parameters and return type and is expected to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.781524034Z"}
{"id":"8f6cbd8d-9310-4726-9855-3bb2892e35a3","expr":"result != null","rationale":"According to the code, if both fv1 and fv2 are non-null, a new FieldVisitorTee is returned, which is non-null; if one is null, the other (non-null) is returned; so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.781541267Z"}
