{"id":"2cab267f-27f6-4bcf-b42c-dd3cbe437001","expr":"source == null || debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"The debug string can be null or non-null. If non-null, its length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.786830469Z"}
{"id":"59e78868-1cae-4b49-b4d4-abb026ebd8ca","expr":"source == null || source.length() >= 0","rationale":"The source string length is non-negative when source is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.786830469Z"}
{"id":"c7b222d8-bb01-4d71-94f5-6242c7e8b466","expr":"(source == null) || (debug == null) || true","rationale":"No strong logical relation between source and debug can be derived here, but both can be null or non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.786830469Z"}
{"id":"6b5b418d-f309-4e40-ae2d-d2b1fb54242e","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"Since owner identifies a class, it is expected to be non-null when visiting outer class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.789314694Z"}
