{"id":"0d28f0a9-0ef1-4f65-b96f-6925aaa81e99","expr":"(name != null) || (desc == null)","rationale":"name and desc represent method name and signature; if descriptor is present, method name should be too.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.789314694Z"}
{"id":"224aa5bb-25f0-4f6b-801a-a35a0b225c75","expr":"owner.length() > 0","rationale":"owner identifies a class name and should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.789314694Z"}
{"id":"737a394c-9cb1-46b7-85ff-d1b81dbe7430","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' parameter must not be null as it is directly used in method calls cv1.visitOuterClass and cv2.visitOuterClass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.791893416Z"}
{"id":"48fe9d6f-4e63-4fb1-a631-40d7595ed9ad","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is expected to be a valid type descriptor or annotation description string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.791980340Z"}
