{"id":"36def1b2-fc8c-455b-84ff-8ace42a1e0a5","expr":"owner.length() > 0","rationale":"Typically, the 'owner' string in ASM or similar bytecode libraries represents a class name and is expected to be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.791893416Z"}
