{"id":"73e414bb-d965-4da8-b5fc-73b4bffd87c2","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns the result of AnnotationVisitorTee.getInstance(...) which likely never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.795482233Z"}
