{"id":"a25d0fa0-3b59-480a-b747-2ba9547e57eb","expr":"attrs != null","rationale":"The method visitAttribute is called with attrs, so attrs is expected not to be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.797528501Z"}
{"id":"d970ded3-c5c8-4630-b5ca-77503f7be8ef","expr":"!attrs.isEmpty()","rationale":"If Attribute provides an isEmpty() method, the attribute being visited is typically non-empty, but this depends on available methods which are not guaranteed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.797528501Z"}
