{"id":"2ba410d4-449a-4833-9acb-7889abc7c2ae","expr":"attrs.toString() != null","rationale":"Typically, toString() returns a non-null string, indicating the attribute can be represented as text.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.797528501Z"}
{"id":"2d7919e3-dcc2-4a46-a9d0-0ca1a1c5e93e","expr":"attrs.hashCode() >= 0","rationale":"Hash codes should be consistent and mostly non-negative depending on implementation, giving an invariant to consider.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.797528501Z"}
