{"id":"84e81894-6ef5-4750-8d98-f32b552d990e","expr":"Integer.bitCount(typeRef) <= 32","rationale":"typeRef is an int encoding type annotation reference info; bitCount can indicate non-negative bits set.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.801530086Z"}
