{"id":"4ced8bb6-e319-4849-a026-00d056739d71","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns an AnnotationVisitor obtained from AnnotationVisitorTee.getInstance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.803068747Z"}
{"id":"1a5c2fc3-d98e-4b16-b3b9-a2f83f1717d6","expr":"(!visible || result != null)","rationale":"The visibility boolean does not affect the non-nullity of the returned AnnotationVisitor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.803068747Z"}
{"id":"474d9ed1-ea99-4e3d-9935-371876bb3d45","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method uses attr as an argument, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.804565409Z"}
