{"id":"d9adee0b-058c-4d7e-8aeb-787730a55aab","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is provided as a type descriptor string that is typically non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.807870120Z"}
