{"id":"ffe74d8d-46dc-4060-ac26-89a8fc3c9d74","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The method likely requires a non-null target ClassVisitor to create the ClassVisitorTee wrapper.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerTee#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.809126790Z"}
{"id":"d0c0bc95-cf01-42e9-ac24-93c758f137f2","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The method setTarget creates a new ClassVisitorTee with the given target, implying target is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerTee#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.809630039Z"}
{"id":"65eb8cfc-d97b-4a40-8e1d-8a384c80c743","expr":"target != null","rationale":"At method entry target should be non-null since it is immediately used in super.setTarget and pass.setTarget.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.812121627Z"}
{"id":"3ba05c69-ec9c-415b-8559-62dd150e289d","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The setTarget method typically requires a non-null ClassVisitor to function properly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.813432007Z"}
{"id":"29055bda-e5ba-4c7f-8f76-00435e30176e","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"Class file version should be a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.813513732Z"}
{"id":"a03c2f30-778b-497b-b859-ffb8c7b13306","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Internal class name should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.813513732Z"}
{"id":"065c4c42-599d-4179-b366-09252c289c07","expr":"interfaces != null","rationale":"Interfaces array should be initialized, even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.813513732Z"}
{"id":"47caa95a-f119-4f45-b0e8-a8b8167df373","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() > 0","rationale":"Signature is either null or a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.813513732Z"}
{"id":"a51f2e05-0e4d-4825-ae7e-5328e7ef0ee1","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"Version number is expected to be non-negative in visited classes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.816046717Z"}
{"id":"735a6dff-9163-4a27-8072-5846ea6ab732","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method likely expects a valid class name string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.816046717Z"}
{"id":"a0de139a-8c6e-4282-bcbf-d816a6816f4e","expr":"superName == null || !superName.equals(name)","rationale":"Invariants about inheritance hierarchy consistency.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.816046717Z"}
{"id":"12cd5fd0-6e3a-484e-8b19-37df0ac07fa5","expr":"interfaces != null","rationale":"Visiting a class normally provides an interfaces array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.816046717Z"}
{"id":"b77bd2a3-bcf2-49fa-b1d6-dc83d3e22b69","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags as integer bitmasks are non-negative values.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.816046717Z"}
{"id":"349f5f55-7e24-42a4-a5fb-73a0dd6c4369","expr":"source != null","rationale":"Since the source string is passed to another method, it is likely expected not to be null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.817788131Z"}
{"id":"bf961585-34dd-4ec3-9979-83a9f71a50c1","expr":"source == null || source.length() >= 0","rationale":"The source parameter, if not null, is a valid String with a length property.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.817898289Z"}
{"id":"d78429b2-6c02-4058-9ab7-66f87ef5f41f","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"Debug can be null or a non-empty or empty string at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.817788131Z"}
{"id":"00fa4703-57f7-4e91-9566-3e22306f7c85","expr":"source.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.817788131Z"}
{"id":"151731ff-4d4f-4ac4-8c93-ecf87dc109ae","expr":"debug == null || !debug.isEmpty()","rationale":"If debug is non-null, it usually contains information, so not empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.817788131Z"}
{"id":"81aa1757-ff2f-4d9f-a3b5-e4e2586068f6","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"The debug parameter, if not null, is a valid String with a length property.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.817898289Z"}
{"id":"f63b621a-0d46-4345-b0b7-946f4dc90302","expr":"source != null || debug != null","rationale":"This is a plausible invariant given that the visitSource call likely involves at least one of the parameters being non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.817898289Z"}
{"id":"6dd79d00-b4a1-4a37-b00b-2201b7bbbe3e","expr":"(source != null && debug != null) || (source == null || debug == null)","rationale":"This captures a partition of states but is trivial. It is still not tautological because it groups both parameters null and not null states.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.817898289Z"}
{"id":"418d6bea-93fe-4194-8c0f-0da5d582d2d4","expr":"source == null || debug == null || source != null && debug != null","rationale":"This expression tries to suggest that either both are null or both are non-null, capturing a possible relation in usage patterns.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.817898289Z"}
{"id":"e7f2309f-4462-497d-8f83-b8c90f6e283f","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' should be a valid class name string, most likely not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.820209086Z"}
{"id":"12dd02f6-9967-4bdb-98df-4ade14221f94","expr":"(name == null) || (name.length() > 0)","rationale":"'name' if defined, should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.820209086Z"}
{"id":"d2941ee0-6363-4a2f-aabd-3cd6a79d74be","expr":"(desc == null) || desc.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"When 'desc' represents a method signature descriptor, it conventionally starts with '('.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.820209086Z"}
{"id":"d1282b5a-6990-4e9e-8f2f-d786cfd5a3cc","expr":"(name != null) || (desc == null)","rationale":"Either both 'name' and 'desc' are null or 'name' is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.820209086Z"}
{"id":"c4e4172d-2352-4e13-833d-10329bf58dac","expr":"owner.length() > 0","rationale":"'owner' is expected to be a non-empty string representing a class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.820209086Z"}
{"id":"fcf5974a-a850-49e4-a39a-bfc4e281dd93","expr":"desc != null && desc.length() > 0","rationale":"Annotation descriptor strings are non-null and typically non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.822354070Z"}
{"id":"5db79708-3062-4ee9-a3e1-1a2c53277e6e","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean flag indicating the visibility of the annotation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.822354070Z"}
{"id":"b8e72ecb-4914-4010-9040-c00eb2322f97","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The owner argument usually represents the internal JVM name of an enclosing class, which should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.822435303Z"}
{"id":"fbe9dac8-0b03-48de-aa86-6f1eb2e99382","expr":"name == null || name.length() > 0","rationale":"When name is provided, it is typically a method name and thus should be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.822435303Z"}
{"id":"31f4c2ca-e53c-48a0-bc42-9c83fbe351dd","expr":"desc == null || desc.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"If desc is not null, it is likely a method descriptor, which conventionally starts with '(' in JVM bytecode signatures.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.822435303Z"}
{"id":"fd037043-c8ab-4ca3-9cc2-5a64012268c5","expr":"(name == null && desc == null) || (name != null && desc != null)","rationale":"Since name and desc represent the method's name and descriptor, they are likely provided together or both omitted.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.822435303Z"}
{"id":"1999fb1a-8f36-4127-ab36-784aadae0dce","expr":"owner != null && name != null && desc != null","rationale":"The method delegates to target.visitOuterClass passing these three parameters; likely, none are null when the call occurs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.822435303Z"}
{"id":"a6a6a507-7fcb-4c90-b5ef-52a78b7e930a","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty() && result != null && visible == (visible || !visible)","rationale":"The method delegates visitAnnotation to target, so result corresponds to target's visitAnnotation result which typically expects a non-null desc and returns non-null visitor if annotation is recognized.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.824539391Z"}
{"id":"4463850a-35b7-4aa4-8bb5-526b1c4130e6","expr":"result != null","rationale":"It is likely that visitAnnotation returns a non-null AnnotationVisitor when an annotation matching description is present.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.824539391Z"}
{"id":"7fda7bf0-c2be-43e4-90ac-97e8b287e111","expr":"result != null || !visible","rationale":"Usually, visible controls accessibility of annotations; result might be null for invisible annotations.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.824539391Z"}
{"id":"b0bcc2c1-febc-4337-86d4-bcfde4bec9e2","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method uses attr as a parameter to another method call without a prior null check, so attr must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.826356106Z"}
{"id":"50c86096-beb8-4257-ab7f-94ff708f1dcf","expr":"attr.getName() != null","rationale":"The Attribute class typically mandates a non-null name field for valid attributes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.826356106Z"}
{"id":"78443021-ed9d-4161-a155-c281c7415f7c","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method delegates the call to target.visitAttribute(attr), so attr should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.827970130Z"}
{"id":"d50c4d5f-c800-43ee-be83-090f35bdab67","expr":"name != null","rationale":"name is being passed to target.visitInnerClass, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.829178899Z"}
{"id":"2aead384-b427-4d8d-9828-704ae970907b","expr":"innerName != null","rationale":"innerName is being passed to target.visitInnerClass, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.829178899Z"}
{"id":"206b71b1-d025-4dfb-9919-1d99b31c9559","expr":"(outerName == null) || (outerName.length() > 0)","rationale":"outerName may be null or a non-empty string identifying outer class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.829178899Z"}
{"id":"d5812928-8b64-4eda-a2c0-3b7c97ab02d2","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags are typically non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.829178899Z"}
{"id":"10d1bcc3-e48b-490e-9a8b-8e2ddac7479a","expr":"!(innerName != null && outerName != null) || !innerName.equals(outerName)","rationale":"If both innerName and outerName are non-null, they should not be equal as inner and outer classes have distinct names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.829178899Z"}
{"id":"be8bb2bd-f385-4130-843c-ec975f57e391","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0 && !name.contains(\"$\")","rationale":"Typically, inner class names are non-null, non-empty and do not contain the '$' character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.831047773Z"}
{"id":"b27b37b1-0bbc-496e-9fc8-8affbdcbfb0d","expr":"outerName == null || outerName.length() > 0","rationale":"outerName is either null indicating no outer class or a valid non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.831047773Z"}
{"id":"b04032a4-b90b-4bd6-8034-5380b366a5cf","expr":"innerName == null || innerName.length() > 0","rationale":"innerName is either null or a non-empty identifier string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.831047773Z"}
{"id":"d824a882-f8ca-47d4-9943-bdaee1c31bcc","expr":"(access & 0x0001) == 0 || (access & 0x0002) == 0 || (access & 0x0004) == 0","rationale":"Access flags commonly include visibility modifiers corresponding to 0x0001, 0x0002, or 0x0004 bits set.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.831047773Z"}
{"id":"15b78abf-2ca7-422c-92b7-7aa8aea467b4","expr":"name.equals(innerName) || outerName == null","rationale":"Ensures that the inner class name differs from the enclosing class unless outerName is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.831047773Z"}
{"id":"31aaf6c7-c308-4db4-b3ea-9d9254e45ff3","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The field name parameter is expected to be a valid string to identify the field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.833687219Z"}
{"id":"62bea3d8-6e95-4821-84c0-1065d641b60d","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method delegates to target.visitField and returns its result, which is likely non-null for a valid FieldVisitor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.833692700Z"}
{"id":"6a677f1a-077f-4fcd-a47d-a473b0fec828","expr":"(name != null && desc != null) || result == null","rationale":"If name or desc are null, the visitField result could be null as some implementations might return null if parameters are invalid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.833692700Z"}
{"id":"c05fa813-c18f-4765-82a5-556595d2ee09","expr":"signature == null || value == null || result != null","rationale":"If signature or value are provided, the result should be non-null as the delegate likely creates meaningful visitors.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.833692700Z"}
{"id":"830cfb0d-4a36-483a-8437-eea3e6d6a66e","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor string should be non-null to specify the type of the field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.833687219Z"}
