{"id":"82e61d64-afb7-4746-bfaf-511745133194","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() >= 0","rationale":"Signature if present is a string describing generic signature or null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.835719662Z"}
{"id":"6f2b2a10-71c3-4339-a143-3c1ad0bfb3ce","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"Exceptions array may be null or if not null has a non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.835719662Z"}
{"id":"ccebb158-22a4-4bf1-9f3d-841dab4c1723","expr":"(exceptions != null) || (exceptions == null)","rationale":"Trivial check to satisfy condition coverage but can be omitted.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.835719662Z"}
{"id":"208a7d28-c6cf-413a-81fa-c7a9249c4d57","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns target.visitMethod, which is generally expected to return a non-null MethodVisitor, result != null holds.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.838634387Z"}
{"id":"a3a01b88-5e87-4ac5-9c99-4c690c788612","expr":"target == null || target.getClass().getName() != null && !target.getClass().getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"Ensures that if target is not null, it refers to a valid ClassVisitor instance with a non-empty class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassTransformer#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.840088128Z"}
{"id":"3032676e-108e-4392-b92e-60a847a0f66b","expr":"v != null","rationale":"The input parameter v, representing a ClassVisitor, must be non-null as it is used to set the chain target.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.842821933Z"}
{"id":"041f2f35-dab1-4dfd-ab6e-000b55191e79","expr":"v != null","rationale":"The parameter v is assigned in the loop and passed to setTarget on chain elements.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.843181872Z"}
{"id":"417b1222-f79e-4615-8065-b89000bf7585","expr":"name != null","rationale":"A method must have a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.845175771Z"}
{"id":"bc786ac0-ac5a-401b-8325-3fb4abfc8d7e","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"To describe the method signature, desc must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.845175771Z"}
{"id":"26bb5c39-b647-4f43-a792-96579d5d3cc9","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"Exceptions array may be null or non-null and non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.845175771Z"}
{"id":"a10e4c1d-cda7-42f7-a3bc-deeb197a002b","expr":"(signature == null) || (signature.length() > 0)","rationale":"Signature is optional; if given, it is not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.845175771Z"}
{"id":"6f3afcd8-7f6f-4ab6-a60b-2f3f8fe75253","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The delegate visitMethod on cv returns a MethodVisitor which is assigned to result, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.845810669Z"}
{"id":"ed2fd695-d328-408c-8c33-981caa2f3bfb","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags are non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.845175771Z"}
{"id":"c63eff3b-5189-4a03-abcd-b22b3efb822b","expr":"v != null","rationale":"The ClassVisitor parameter v is set as the target for t, so v must be non-null at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.TransformingClassGenerator#generateClass(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/TransformingClassGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.847810640Z"}
{"id":"5c06c7b3-2d61-4400-b848-ca578fab88fd","expr":"result.contains(\", \") == (result.indexOf(\", \") > -1)","rationale":"If the result contains \", \", it implies the chain had multiple elements separated by commas.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#toString():String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.848691260Z"}
{"id":"6decae65-5ca8-49e6-8184-b9f1e1d0147e","expr":"v != null","rationale":"The ClassVisitor parameter must not be null since it is being set as a target for transformation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.TransformingClassGenerator#generateClass(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/TransformingClassGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.847885821Z"}
{"id":"5735dad1-8782-40fa-8213-311e9dba1889","expr":"nLocal >= 0","rationale":"nLocal represents the number of local variables, which cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.858347397Z"}
{"id":"eeb21661-e314-4ba8-8b58-017e88c2f9e2","expr":"nStack >= 0","rationale":"nStack represents the number of stack elements, which cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.858347397Z"}
{"id":"e9d107b2-e270-4d06-9b15-5534e67f11f6","expr":"local != null || nLocal == 0","rationale":"If there are zero local variables, local may be null; otherwise, it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.858347397Z"}
{"id":"20ca4381-6bd2-4633-b7a9-eb44412a339b","expr":"type >= 0","rationale":"The ASM API defines frame type constants as non-negative integers","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.858448808Z"}
{"id":"53630158-987e-4953-92bb-8051b7e21b63","expr":"nLocal >= 0","rationale":"Java frames have a non-negative count of local variables","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.858448808Z"}
{"id":"5e907ac0-30de-4ff2-8cfe-8823b3172619","expr":"(local == null) || (local.length >= nLocal)","rationale":"The local array should have enough entries for the given count of local variables","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.858448808Z"}
{"id":"1749ef36-d13e-45eb-8156-78fc44bebf9f","expr":"nStack >= 0","rationale":"The operand stack size is never negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.858448808Z"}
{"id":"24579954-d3fa-4c60-ac10-0c6e943abb11","expr":"stack != null || nStack == 0","rationale":"If the stack size is zero, stack array may be null; otherwise, it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.858347397Z"}
{"id":"32cb13e0-1639-485c-b5c2-c4dbfe5c5339","expr":"local != null && nLocal <= local.length","rationale":"The nLocal count cannot be greater than the available slots in the local array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.858347397Z"}
{"id":"9979faad-df2c-4f42-a38a-43e196eb5b6e","expr":"(stack == null) || (stack.length >= nStack)","rationale":"The stack array should have enough entries for the given count of stack elements","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.858448808Z"}
{"id":"dd493365-dc64-4250-a5c5-8faa4c9e52e9","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since visitAnnotationDefault() returns the combined result of two visits, the result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotationDefault():AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.868213149Z"}
{"id":"a8845a8d-4cc3-494f-8094-b0b1faa5233c","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc should be a valid descriptor string required to create an annotation visitor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.868271028Z"}
{"id":"9824c16f-8b36-4fc0-bca3-e6f73014d4e5","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean parameter, so this invariant just reflects that it’s boolean.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.868271028Z"}
{"id":"70af889d-c74e-4966-b1fd-860a332d21e5","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"desc should be a non-empty string to represent valid annotation descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.868271028Z"}
{"id":"04178834-bddc-4303-9be3-24e7b8b18e37","expr":"result.visitAnnotationDefault() == null","rationale":"The returned visitor might delegate some calls to underlying visitors, and calling visitAnnotationDefault() on it could return null as is common for certain visitors.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotationDefault():AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.868213149Z"}
{"id":"b54facab-1e91-46e9-9e95-9a7e06ba786d","expr":"result.hashCode() != 0","rationale":"To distinguish instances, the result object should have a stable and non-zero hash code.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotationDefault():AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.868213149Z"}
{"id":"3192499b-97cc-4500-8c1e-253f4251f49f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a combined object from two other visitAnnotation calls, the result is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.870148488Z"}
{"id":"c8bd50d7-ab68-4043-947d-a456eef72ebd","expr":"!result.equals(null)","rationale":"The result object is expected to be a non-null AnnotationVisitor instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.870148488Z"}
{"id":"50f995dc-40e6-4ccb-97b9-479cd9685415","expr":"(desc != null) == (result != null)","rationale":"Typically a visitAnnotation call returns non-null only if the description is provided.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.870148488Z"}
{"id":"a9957d68-6368-4f9b-8e51-9a549f9809d8","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned AnnotationVisitor result from visitParameterAnnotation should never be null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameterAnnotation(int,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.877651085Z"}
{"id":"8204c34d-5fa5-4843-aaec-84c5bc19930f","expr":"parameter >= 0","rationale":"Parameter indices are usually zero or positive integers in method signatures.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameterAnnotation(int,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.877676302Z"}
{"id":"1cabbfd2-d435-40e8-831f-3cab103c1c92","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Description strings for annotations are expected to be non-null as they represent type descriptors.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameterAnnotation(int,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.877676302Z"}
{"id":"1404e0e1-a2d1-42e3-9da1-e5b98245396c","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"The visible parameter is a boolean and can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameterAnnotation(int,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.877676302Z"}
{"id":"61d177eb-8fad-400f-947a-735686e1a277","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"Since attr is passed directly to mv1.visitAttribute and mv2.visitAttribute without null checks, attr should not be null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.881917359Z"}
{"id":"3f0883aa-4b3c-41be-8a9b-ee4da05fdf4a","expr":"attr.length >= 0","rationale":"Attributes typically have a non-negative length field indicating their data size or length","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.881917359Z"}
{"id":"8f254339-478b-4e81-aa7e-9d58f44a4d75","expr":"attr.data != null || attr.length == 0","rationale":"An Attribute with no data might have data as null only if length is zero, otherwise data should be non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.881917359Z"}
{"id":"c3e01233-91d8-4c72-8205-755ab068ec0b","expr":"attr.isCodeAttribute() == false","rationale":"Depending on the attribute, this could be true as common attributes differ; assuming false as typical non-code attribute","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.881917359Z"}
{"id":"fdbc7739-8599-4536-be0c-180105832350","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method calls visitAttribute on mv1 and mv2 with attr; attr must not be null for these calls to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.887073411Z"}
{"id":"2ec93b9c-ac42-4137-a55f-d3f7fa18c797","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"The opcode likely represents a bytecode instruction, which is usually a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.895593335Z"}
{"id":"e57f6fea-b6c1-4c3c-9ebf-d79b48662658","expr":"opcode <= 255","rationale":"In Java bytecode, opcode is an unsigned byte value between 0 and 255.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.895593335Z"}
{"id":"70af3217-e761-47de-bca9-f5c10dbca581","expr":"opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255","rationale":"Opcode for JVM instructions is typically between 0 and 255 inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.895736846Z"}
{"id":"780bcd48-05eb-406b-a392-78049cb826bf","expr":"opcode != 0","rationale":"visitInsn should not receive opcode 0 if it represents a valid instruction call.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.895736846Z"}
{"id":"4e9150c9-7253-416c-bdaa-a5d1b25336e1","expr":"opcode != 202","rationale":"The opcode should correspond to a valid JVM instruction; 202 is outside known opcode values.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.895736846Z"}
{"id":"7a9a2a41-c769-49fb-9711-43c38f524675","expr":"opcode != 255","rationale":"Opcode 255 is not a recognized JVM opcode.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.895736846Z"}
{"id":"07832a7e-f789-4181-b97c-4aceb0936c27","expr":"opcode != -1","rationale":"Opcode values are non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.895736846Z"}
{"id":"08e7b179-cbfe-40d0-b771-9ef3f371e1c2","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode represents bytecode instructions which are usually non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.903764382Z"}
{"id":"e7c02649-5d4f-4a28-aa76-c3b8ff74b25f","expr":"operand >= 0","rationale":"Operand in visitIntInsn likely to be non-negative as it represents an integer operand.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.903764382Z"}
{"id":"e2f4bbdb-f61d-4a19-a1b6-3060a07e20fb","expr":"(opcode == 16) || (opcode == 17) || (opcode == 18) || (opcode == 19) || (opcode == 20)","rationale":"visitIntInsn is called only for certain opcodes within the JVM which typically include BIPUSH (16), SIPUSH (17), etc.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.903764382Z"}
