{"id":"f2215dfe-4d90-499d-b11d-3a5a5ffa17b7","expr":"opcode != 0 || operand != 0","rationale":"Zero zero opcode and operand might be invalid or indicative of an uninitialized state.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.904558048Z"}
{"id":"2f0ca916-d376-4e64-b2e2-768d96a697b6","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode values correspond to bytecode instruction opcodes which are non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.904890335Z"}
