{"id":"0c2fd19d-28fb-45d6-9e03-564d745468a8","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcodes are generally non-negative integers representing JVM instructions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.925297083Z"}
{"id":"435a74d6-52c2-47e4-a2ba-9939fe13239b","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"Owner usually represents a class name and should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.925297083Z"}
{"id":"a340efc4-17cf-45db-b5fb-c4f786ee0726","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Name representing field name should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.925297083Z"}
{"id":"9c722e05-a81f-4856-9b0e-8984e6c87662","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Descriptor string for field type should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.925297083Z"}
{"id":"00a5329a-bdab-4258-b51a-f9f9544f8735","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"opcode is expected to be a valid bytecode instruction opcode, typically non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.931902778Z"}
{"id":"30a5f9db-c856-483a-8749-05ecded96d22","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"owner denotes the internal name of the class owning the method; it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.931902778Z"}
