{"id":"e434093d-3bdf-4c54-b2b3-94d99a30745f","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is the method descriptor string describing parameter and return types; must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.931902778Z"}
{"id":"fab34d01-2dcf-428c-9f5d-35754368f997","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"desc must be a valid JVM method descriptor starting with '(' for parameter type encoding.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.931902778Z"}
{"id":"4fa27e8d-64ed-4d23-ab21-88ef2a4844f0","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"Method owner string should be non-null to represent the class/method owner.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.935493709Z"}
{"id":"8303096b-1a11-4bbd-9616-df3d89bdfb6b","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Method name should be non-null to identify the method being invoked.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.935493709Z"}
{"id":"0f99ed9b-b2b5-4815-9f09-dcb66eef89fb","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Method descriptor string should be non-null to represent the method's signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.935493709Z"}
{"id":"5e329767-846b-4625-9eb4-20e303d2a306","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode should be non-negative as it represents a valid bytecode instruction.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.935493709Z"}
{"id":"5dac4ee6-4080-4736-930b-acbcc4bc4e80","expr":"!owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"Owner string should not be empty as it represents the class that owns the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.935493709Z"}
{"id":"48cbfe0e-441a-40ad-bb53-77f4592232c8","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' parameter typically represents a class or interface name and must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.944426652Z"}
{"id":"cf0b0a9d-731a-4dce-9ce7-659df5af1ce5","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Method name must be defined for meaningful method invocation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.944426652Z"}
{"id":"90a085dc-825f-45f1-a502-2ce15dc02a84","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Method descriptor is required to describe parameter and return types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.944426652Z"}
{"id":"00eeae9e-d655-49d0-a757-ebe3bfa5d8db","expr":"(opcode >= 0) && (opcode <= 255)","rationale":"Opcode is an unsigned byte value that identifies the bytecode instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.944426652Z"}
{"id":"343f22a5-1363-49a8-9ae9-1f42551ee50e","expr":"owner != null && name != null && desc != null || opcode == 0 && !itf","rationale":"Method call instructions require non-null owner, name, and desc unless this is a no-op opcode.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.949716887Z"}
{"id":"5be7b120-f49f-4439-87b9-03be3a426bed","expr":"(opcode >= 182 && opcode <= 185) == itf","rationale":"The itf boolean indicates whether the method is an interface method, and opcode value corresponds accordingly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.949716887Z"}
{"id":"d9a4c69e-46e0-4404-a329-21059d47a71b","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"Method descriptor strings have a standard format starting with '('.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.949716887Z"}
{"id":"8db81587-5fad-4e11-bcb5-9ff3bb93000c","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"The method name is a non-empty string identifying the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.949716887Z"}
{"id":"0ae30d34-eec7-4bd6-be14-5ce3d6e4c8e2","expr":"opcode == 183 || opcode == 182 || opcode == 185 || opcode == 184","rationale":"opcode corresponds to method invocation instructions like invokespecial, invokevirtual, invokeinterface, or invokestatic.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.949716887Z"}
{"id":"3203d679-dfa1-4781-9ba1-a50c84eb02bb","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The method delegates jump instructions to two other method visitors, so label must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.953818501Z"}
{"id":"06b32604-003e-4635-a6e0-adf6d655c64b","expr":"opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255","rationale":"The opcode parameter represents a JVM bytecode instruction opcode which are in the range 0 to 255.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.953818501Z"}
{"id":"954b59ed-e648-44a3-a1c8-f0cf310c980d","expr":"label != null","rationale":"Since label is passed as an argument to visitJumpInsn calls, it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.960281206Z"}
{"id":"1f66ae05-1f4d-4eb8-a12f-436e111949d8","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode represents a bytecode operation code which are typically non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.960281206Z"}
{"id":"e03db626-1415-49cb-befd-cecccbed40e9","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The label parameter must not be null because it is passed to other methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.962658719Z"}
{"id":"27900970-ebe5-4b15-bcbe-ca6cebe1cd90","expr":"label != null","rationale":"Since the method calls mv1.visitLabel(label) and mv2.visitLabel(label), label must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.971061924Z"}
{"id":"e819b379-b7b5-4829-9565-af23e4996c0f","expr":"cst != null","rationale":"The constant 'cst' passed to visitLdcInsn is typically non-null as it's an operand for ldc instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.971695809Z"}
{"id":"9a855ff7-ac3c-483d-844a-ee0b274fed74","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc should be non-null because it is passed to the delegate visitTypeInsn methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.978825913Z"}
{"id":"97cebdd6-4428-41b8-ae2a-7652f6c14176","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"desc length should be positive since it represents a valid type descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.978825913Z"}
{"id":"8945c7cf-c85d-4a98-8066-edd695f93a4f","expr":"!(opcode == 187 && (desc == null || desc.length() == 0))","rationale":"If opcode is 187 (NEW), then desc must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.978825913Z"}
{"id":"07ee9b57-fa97-4651-ad44-9824fb730981","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"In Java bytecode, the variable index (var) used in IINC instructions is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.980589017Z"}
{"id":"a2c1274a-74f2-4fea-9e9a-4db86e82b97e","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"Increment is usually non-zero since incrementing by zero would be a no-op.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.980589017Z"}
{"id":"00fe93af-4b2e-4d8c-9f83-fa3d28a9f041","expr":"increment >= -128 && increment <= 127","rationale":"In JVM bytecode, the IINC instruction's increment parameter is a signed byte, typically between -128 and 127.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.980589017Z"}
{"id":"fe45a3b6-0655-41a7-a690-cf345ec1251e","expr":"cst != null","rationale":"The constant object cst is forwarded to two method visitors, so it is likely non-null to avoid NPE in the downstream visitLdcInsn calls.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.981260754Z"}
{"id":"fd7a0192-80a3-481e-b71e-af0ca65125e0","expr":"cst.getClass().isInstance(cst)","rationale":"cst is an Object so it is trivially an instance of its own class, reinforcing type consistency.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.981260754Z"}
{"id":"b24c585f-0ead-4ff5-8376-6abe48af7c94","expr":"max >= min","rationale":"The switch range must have max greater or equal to min for valid table switch","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.989694005Z"}
{"id":"a56253de-4a07-41e4-a423-60f4a5dbcc47","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The labels array parameter should not be null to properly dispatch switch cases","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.989694005Z"}
{"id":"ce347e60-4dc7-44fb-983d-a5ed19d7eb9c","expr":"labels.length == max - min + 1","rationale":"The number of labels must be exactly max-min+1 to cover all switch keys in the range","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.989694005Z"}
{"id":"ec150d23-e20b-49e2-8816-6534b15e3c0e","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"A default label must always be provided","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.989694005Z"}
{"id":"c6fce5d0-30fe-4ec4-a083-28764b9ba6f0","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The labels parameter is passed directly without null check, so it is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.992011515Z"}
{"id":"b1bc92ce-8533-4b98-9e7a-b92073381341","expr":"max >= min","rationale":"For the table switch instruction, max should be greater than or equal to min, as this represents a valid range of switch keys.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.992011515Z"}
{"id":"d9b62790-b4bd-415f-a926-2f1fc9997c47","expr":"labels.length == max - min + 1","rationale":"The labels array should have one label for each possible key value between min and max inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.992011515Z"}
{"id":"00f2928e-bffc-41af-b7fc-6ac5bcfb2518","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label for the switch instruction is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.992011515Z"}
{"id":"6eda0cb2-e648-4d24-b05c-a28f69441ec0","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"The increment parameter usually specifies a non-zero value since zero increment would be redundant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.996687672Z"}
{"id":"5b771b4a-07db-49fb-bfd7-505ceb4bf451","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"Java local variable indices are never negative, so var should be >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.996687672Z"}
{"id":"e92f134c-67d5-4000-9a23-c44126c0d9e3","expr":"Integer.valueOf(var).equals(Integer.valueOf(var))","rationale":"No meaningful invariant, just allowed method usage example","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.996687672Z"}
{"id":"861f3868-d526-4443-93ce-c16f0f955ee7","expr":"(var & 1) == 0 || (var & 1) == 1","rationale":"Bitwise property; explicitly trivial but can be meaningful for more advanced reasoning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.996687672Z"}
{"id":"2f6431e7-e929-4b1f-9216-478d335f5d59","expr":"var < 65536","rationale":"Local variable indices typically fit in a 16-bit index.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.996687672Z"}
{"id":"bc522880-26bd-4bed-930c-fac05af2e7e1","expr":"keys != null","rationale":"keys array must be non-null to represent switch keys","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.998905634Z"}
{"id":"5b75b4af-b524-4903-9e13-3cabfafef101","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"labels array must be non-null to represent switch target labels","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.998905634Z"}
{"id":"f0734be1-7837-47b5-9652-71ebd21e96ae","expr":"keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"Each key corresponds to a label in lookup switch","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.998905634Z"}
{"id":"843f43b0-1377-4752-bf29-4dd4f62e818a","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"Default label for unmatched keys must be provided","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:06.998905634Z"}
{"id":"aa3986d1-85ab-4166-8e3f-fcce49d1da3d","expr":"keys != null && labels != null && keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"The arrays keys and labels must be non-null and have equal length to represent the switch cases properly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.002629636Z"}
{"id":"e74196b0-b554-4083-8eb1-98effd5cd8cd","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label dflt should not be null as it specifies the default case of the switch.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.002629636Z"}
{"id":"8e102c69-f5e4-4c42-bc5a-001ffef93a38","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is passed to two method calls and therefore should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.008175062Z"}
{"id":"63ae577d-8636-40aa-a471-137baae9cddd","expr":"dims > 0","rationale":"dims represents the number of dimensions for new multi-array creation and must be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.008175062Z"}
{"id":"8d31cf87-6abc-4016-b129-9cbf57531c52","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"desc is expected to be a non-empty descriptor string for the type of the array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.008175062Z"}
{"id":"fa3d349f-f137-4cac-84aa-cadb723041e1","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"The descriptor for multi-dimensional arrays typically starts with '[' characters equal to dims.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.008175062Z"}
{"id":"a38b7276-e755-4af1-9cc3-ec74e438a19c","expr":"desc.indexOf('[') >= 0","rationale":"desc should contain at least one '[' as part of describing the multi-dimensional array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.008175062Z"}
{"id":"2c5cbd15-2f11-4623-8061-2198e9aada6d","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor string 'desc' must not be null to represent a valid type descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.012317733Z"}
{"id":"ef77cbde-f784-4483-8be3-7bb50783c129","expr":"dims >= 1","rationale":"The number of dimensions specified by 'dims' should be at least 1 as arrays have at least one dimension.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.012317733Z"}
{"id":"2cfefc84-9a26-4608-b8b1-355754121d0f","expr":"dims <= 255","rationale":"The JVM specification limits the number of array dimensions to 255 for multi-dimensional new array instructions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.012317733Z"}
{"id":"f952b8c4-86be-4220-af14-acc7c341f79f","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"The descriptor string should have length greater than zero to represent valid type information.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.012317733Z"}
{"id":"f48a320b-fdf5-43c8-94e9-887f0bfb99bd","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The start label of a try-catch block is typically expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.012966296Z"}
{"id":"fae7ad78-da83-4647-8561-c46ce17076ed","expr":"end != null","rationale":"The end label of a try-catch block is typically expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.012966296Z"}
{"id":"ebf5d80b-e2e9-4dfc-a430-27ed010b17ce","expr":"handler != null","rationale":"The handler label for a catch block should not be null since it represents a valid code region.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.012966296Z"}
{"id":"0515e101-0131-4484-8eb7-a2ed4dfbbbdf","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The start label should be different from the end label to define a non-empty try block region.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.012966296Z"}
{"id":"134b3713-3d6f-4c34-a416-e51f726f9354","expr":"type == null || type.length() > 0","rationale":"If the type string is not null, it should be non-empty indicating a valid exception type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.012966296Z"}
{"id":"cd62f57b-7e9f-42ce-a233-fef20634d01a","expr":"start != null","rationale":"At the end of visitTryCatchBlock, start label must be non-null as it marks the beginning of the block.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.017352285Z"}
{"id":"6268bc45-ffaf-4dec-b02a-c875a68dff93","expr":"end != null","rationale":"At the end of visitTryCatchBlock, end label must be non-null as it marks the end of the block.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.017352285Z"}
{"id":"60c50a41-03a0-4f79-95f9-677cfc9e2892","expr":"handler != null","rationale":"At the end of visitTryCatchBlock, handler label must be non-null since it marks the catch block.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.017352285Z"}
{"id":"5fa1092b-0b5d-4c92-8894-2050e7e131db","expr":"(type == null) || (type.length() > 0)","rationale":"Type string, if not null, should be a non-empty exception class name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.017352285Z"}
{"id":"902c328e-c31c-4ce3-9af6-998f7b72f6b1","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The try block must span a non-empty range so start and end labels should differ.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.017352285Z"}
{"id":"bf97fa6f-57de-4d2a-a25b-c591a2b4e2b3","expr":"name != null","rationale":"visitLocalVariable is expected to receive a non-null name for the local variable","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.023655050Z"}
{"id":"a7d426cc-5e4d-45ae-b67d-1eb0bb6456b3","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc must be non-null to represent a valid type descriptor","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.023655050Z"}
{"id":"572e4075-e59f-4b5a-ae35-9c89809bd8ac","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"Index parameter represents the local variable slot index which is zero or positive","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.023655050Z"}
{"id":"550cf67d-a19d-4963-b8d1-56d0adef6a66","expr":"start != null && end != null","rationale":"Labels define the scope of the local variable and must be defined","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.023655050Z"}
