{"id":"bef89541-f926-45b0-a6a9-683ca9547699","expr":"line >= 0","rationale":"Line numbers in bytecode represent source code line numbers and are normally non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.035004870Z"}
