{"id":"4123f8e1-a7a9-4ade-b219-bb024b20e055","expr":"maxStack >= maxLocals","rationale":"Typically, stack size is at least as large as number of locals needed for method execution.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.035276132Z"}
