{"id":"c383a4b0-6037-4e53-bbfd-6f1e1fed4000","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method delegates to other visitParameter methods which likely require a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.049745254Z"}
{"id":"61412f80-e7ec-44e7-ae33-2934622d9677","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Typically access represents a set of bit flags; negative values are unusual.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.049745254Z"}
