{"id":"24665200-ae86-4bb4-9591-ae0a226bc98c","expr":"name == null || !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"If name is not null, it should not be empty as parameters generally have meaningful names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.053012845Z"}
