{"id":"89e3d9ef-b15f-4f04-a1ca-0fa3fdf96074","expr":"typeRef <= 0xFFFF","rationale":"typeRef values are constrained to fit within 16 bits as per JVM spec for type annotations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.055536202Z"}
{"id":"f6f506bb-a51c-490e-bd5a-959c12618de1","expr":"(desc.length() > 0)","rationale":"desc is a descriptor string expected to be non-empty for the annotation type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.055536202Z"}
{"id":"fa32eb46-480a-45cc-abd0-4c1bd737146b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned AnnotationVisitor from getInstance wrapping two visits is guaranteed non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.060504961Z"}
