{"id":"467939ea-4869-4f4a-9434-70db3fcd5961","expr":"bsmArgs.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"The parameter bsmArgs is declared as Object but expected to be an Object array at runtime.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.061957821Z"}
