{"id":"3d6596ba-b0ae-4934-b14f-170b5fb07818","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is expected to be a valid type descriptor string, thus should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.077342028Z"}
{"id":"d295f649-2b77-441b-9e5d-a624a65ed22f","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.size() >= 0","rationale":"If typePath is not null, its size should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.077342028Z"}
{"id":"3b019cda-f49f-468d-9dbb-266de6e56583","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"typeRef is generally a reference index and hence should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.077342028Z"}
{"id":"f430fa96-6e4a-448a-bdcb-e076537cb5b3","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean parameter so it logically can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.077342028Z"}
{"id":"3200f793-aa6b-4a09-b213-f7ece7855497","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned AnnotationVisitor 'result' must not be null as the getInstance method constructs a combined visitor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.080003026Z"}
