{"id":"152fa972-e732-450b-bbd8-e1f86e980827","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The start array represents the start labels of local variable scopes, which are essential for annotation processing.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariableAnnotation(int,TypePath,Label[],Label[],int[],String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.081957872Z"}
{"id":"b131bb1d-88eb-491e-b8bd-41146fd8b4df","expr":"end != null","rationale":"The end array marks the end labels for local variable scopes, necessary for annotation processing.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariableAnnotation(int,TypePath,Label[],Label[],int[],String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.081957872Z"}
{"id":"c6640d32-1314-4a74-9d99-5e291983bebb","expr":"index != null","rationale":"The index array represents local variable indices and should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariableAnnotation(int,TypePath,Label[],Label[],int[],String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.081957872Z"}
{"id":"4c67679d-7b98-4503-aabf-4c92fd32b632","expr":"(start.length == end.length) && (start.length == index.length)","rationale":"The lengths of start, end, and index arrays must be equal as they correlate to the local variables annotated.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariableAnnotation(int,TypePath,Label[],Label[],int[],String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.081957872Z"}
{"id":"1e8ee7a2-63b5-4d4f-ac9a-ec4f6a06285d","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The desc is the descriptor of the annotation, expected to be non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariableAnnotation(int,TypePath,Label[],Label[],int[],String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.081957872Z"}
{"id":"fc192ec6-c354-4b13-b3a1-9f722b58743f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns field 'e', which is expected to be non-null at the return point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.Block#getCodeEmitter():CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/Block.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.083339857Z"}
