{"id":"9ce95a8d-240e-4d09-8ba9-594c7ac63565","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned Label (result) is expected to be non-null, as getStart() provides a valid start label.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.Block#getStart():Label","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/Block.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.086618830Z"}
