{"id":"8c4838f5-fe86-4227-9136-907f0299882e","expr":"cg != null","rationale":"The generate method requires a valid ClassGenerator instance to proceed with class generation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.DefaultGeneratorStrategy#generate(ClassGenerator):byte[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/DefaultGeneratorStrategy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:07.175582514Z"}
