{"id":"6e5b0cbd-57df-4504-bb98-2754b0eeb37b","expr":"mode >= 0 && mode <= 7","rationale":"The mode parameter likely corresponds to a limited set of integer constants representing different comparison operations which usually range between 0 and 7 inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#if_icmp(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:15.801677896Z"}
