{"id":"d9518eac-84d4-46b3-8621-ec5b1edc7f28","expr":"!checkAll || callbackTypes.length > 0","rationale":"If checkAll is true, the array likely contains types to check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.388576668Z"}
