{"id":"4e8cf9cc-fc5c-4b17-b5ea-e7e0372b2f59","expr":"result != null","rationale":"According to the method context, determineTypes returns a Type array which is assigned directly from another method call, which is expected not to return null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.447141704Z"}
{"id":"e0a50245-a9b9-451f-8b0e-5b0c06f1cc46","expr":"callbacks == null || result.length == callbacks.length","rationale":"Typically determineTypes map each Callback to one Type, so array sizes are expected to be equal when callbacks is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.447141704Z"}
{"id":"3c2d568c-4367-493f-9d06-dd3c135d0110","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of result, an array, is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.447141704Z"}
{"id":"11f454ed-1dbf-49e5-b124-23502120c751","expr":"callbacks != null && callbacks.length == 0 || result.length == 0","rationale":"If the input callbacks array is empty, then the result array is expected to be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.447141704Z"}
{"id":"fb32d7ea-4e3a-4041-a7f6-17ca6d5d3994","expr":"callbacks != null","rationale":"The method creates an array using callbacks.length, so callbacks must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.458245441Z"}
{"id":"be1a3a65-56df-4660-94e8-f2332eedfa54","expr":"callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.458245441Z"}
{"id":"82d6e3c1-7713-4f3f-839e-e3a5720b1cbe","expr":"checkAll == true || checkAll == false","rationale":"checkAll is a boolean parameter; this is trivial but explicitly stated","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.458245441Z"}
{"id":"e5e51ce0-cfad-45f4-b0de-545f84409fc7","expr":"callbacks.length == (callbacks == null ? 0 : callbacks.length)","rationale":"Length of callbacks if not null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.458245441Z"}
{"id":"17c1eb6d-dacc-4e2c-8c38-4beb06265978","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a new Type[] array of the same length as callbacks, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.470037826Z"}
{"id":"ba11ee4d-2a0f-41fb-ac14-43828ffc1f51","expr":"result.length == callbacks.length","rationale":"The returned Type array length equals callbacks.length as seen from the code creating a new array of this length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.470037826Z"}
{"id":"5b82efb8-df2b-4432-92d2-4fcbbb243718","expr":"callbacks.length == 0 || (result[0] != null)","rationale":"If callbacks is non-empty, the first element of result is assigned the return of determineType which presumably returns a valid Type meaning result[0] != null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.470037826Z"}
{"id":"87500d5e-63fe-4bb8-981b-e702e8856d50","expr":"!checkAll || (result.length > 0)","rationale":"The checkAll flag does not directly affect the length but given the code use, if checkAll is true, callbacks.length (and thus result.length) could be expected to be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.470037826Z"}
{"id":"c312b0da-2848-4724-8b20-1558a0fae855","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of an array in Java is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.470037826Z"}
{"id":"efd5a389-7314-486a-ae73-c0d983950b9b","expr":"callbackTypes != null","rationale":"The method immediately uses callbackTypes.length in array creation, so callbackTypes must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.481418725Z"}
{"id":"45bcbbd4-cdd3-4edb-9eef-6817741a24c1","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of an array in Java is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.481418725Z"}
{"id":"9eb101f8-ae4a-4991-89c6-f1911793f5d3","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0 && callbackTypes.length <= 1000","rationale":"Bounds hinting for array size; upper bound is speculative but common.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.481418725Z"}
{"id":"fa54d9cb-feb1-4ff0-8611-bf2280afd206","expr":"result != null && result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"The method returns an array of CallbackGenerator with the same length as callbackTypes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.492456066Z"}
{"id":"d2231753-abe5-4b99-8656-59e8a23f79d0","expr":"callbackTypes != null || result == null","rationale":"The method may produce a null result only if input is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.492456066Z"}
{"id":"fb6c9bfd-46f6-4a43-bad8-333f5ee2ff72","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method initializes the result array before returning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.492456066Z"}
{"id":"7ef871a7-ac01-4a61-bea9-61e8bdceb8a1","expr":"callback != null","rationale":"The method body throws IllegalStateException if callback is null; so callback is guaranteed non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.503744591Z"}
{"id":"f1f6e7de-94d4-4461-b65f-c5bf38bf8858","expr":"callback.getClass() != null","rationale":"Every non-null object always has a non-null Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.503744591Z"}
{"id":"58c2de89-b96b-4733-8266-5c84327eeb58","expr":"(result != null)","rationale":"Presuming that the determineType method never returns null, result is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.515046541Z"}
{"id":"f810f2e4-c537-43fe-ac50-2556cd0d5201","expr":"result != null && result.getClass().isAssignableFrom(callback.getClass())","rationale":"The result Type is related to the class of the callback instance, reflecting that callback is an instance of a class compatible with the returned Type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.515046541Z"}
{"id":"8ca7b4a5-0259-419f-a571-fce77df2895d","expr":"result != null && callback.getClass() != null","rationale":"Since callback is non-null, its class is also non-null and result is presumably non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.515046541Z"}
{"id":"2a649d8f-aa4f-47b1-a279-b35a18d14173","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"The method calls isAssignableFrom on info.cls with callbackType, so callbackType must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.526762081Z"}
{"id":"e94b8f43-7ac5-43cf-a0d3-109aa55ccb06","expr":"callbackType.isInterface() || !callbackType.isArray()","rationale":"A callback type generally represents a class or interface type, not an array type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.526762081Z"}
{"id":"510bfc1b-de78-43c7-8e3d-dd2b10a01037","expr":"!checkAll || callbackType != null","rationale":"If checkAll is true, callbackType must be non-null to proceed with assignments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.526762081Z"}
{"id":"2c901c31-1609-454e-8cd9-6af491780d76","expr":"checkAll || true","rationale":"checkAll is a boolean so it is either true or false (trivial but valid).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.526762081Z"}
{"id":"eb76dcaa-2da7-420f-b714-829e3c1767be","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Because if no assignable type is found, an exception is thrown, so result is always assigned a non-null Type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.539133388Z"}
{"id":"cd373cf3-1360-40ff-8570-5fb3713b2489","expr":"!checkAll || result != null","rationale":"If !checkAll is true, early return occurs; but result is always non-null if return occurs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.539133388Z"}
{"id":"81b4cfb1-0be2-4a75-810f-6588159b6918","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"The method calls callbackType.equals, so callbackType must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.549648364Z"}
{"id":"b31b1521-2f2a-4f3d-9f34-3d74e53eff86","expr":"callbackType.getClass().getName() != null","rationale":"The getClass name of callbackType is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.549648364Z"}
{"id":"5f9eaa53-b731-4d79-b54c-aaeed0d291f0","expr":"!callbackType.equals(null)","rationale":"callbackType.equals(null) should be false by the equals contract.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.549648364Z"}
{"id":"2fd8fa0f-0b81-4fb2-ade8-e7a61640da0c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a generator retrieved from CALLBACKS, which is never null if found.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.560314735Z"}
{"id":"9625d0c4-f5af-40f7-8b6e-3d34a0185da5","expr":"result.getClass().getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"The generator class inherits from a superclass, indicating expected class hierarchy.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.560314735Z"}
{"id":"9cc7891e-9434-4124-bded-bab201315156","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The code generation requires a non-null ClassEmitter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.567940193Z"}
{"id":"1cbd4023-8e40-4611-8126-4510c54b8d61","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Code generation depends on a valid context.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.567940193Z"}
{"id":"7e857a08-6a0f-43f4-b742-d4932d02f610","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The method implementation list must be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.567940193Z"}
{"id":"ad793f31-584f-4a21-9bd5-85ca702a3ebe","expr":"!methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, code generation implies methods are available.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.567940193Z"}
{"id":"29338ba8-5224-492b-b3f2-f2206e3f8ddf","expr":"methods.iterator() != null","rationale":"Having a valid iterator for methods is required before entering the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.567940193Z"}
{"id":"a199d092-9e6a-40a8-a852-ccc8c4ff9ef6","expr":"methods != null && !methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The generate method iterates over methods, so methods list is expected to be non-null and typically non-empty for effective code generation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.576722012Z"}
{"id":"ed21f78e-fefd-4763-82b2-a3338b6b4ad4","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The ClassEmitter should be non-null to declare fields and generate methods as the method implements code generation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.576722012Z"}
{"id":"f0ec32ee-f8db-4e51-9484-e01a4afc889d","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The context is used extensively to get implementation signature, begin method generation and emit callbacks, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.576722012Z"}
{"id":"ccfed9d7-f87a-486e-93ab-6381c7660a50","expr":"!methods.isEmpty() || ce.getName() != null","rationale":"If methods list is empty (unusual but possible), ClassEmitter should have a valid name to ensure the class context exists.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.576722012Z"}
{"id":"c9966628-e242-4f72-8022-8222867e4ffe","expr":"e != null","rationale":"CodeEmitter e is used as an object reference to invoke methods inside the method body, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.584618481Z"}
{"id":"f3b75fb4-d5da-4012-a62f-bb8dd4c26f34","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Context context is utilized for method calls like context.getImplSignature(...) hence must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.584618481Z"}
{"id":"1717f0cc-969c-4144-9bea-732a8ac0d8a0","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The methods list is iterated over; it must be non-null to prevent NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.584618481Z"}
{"id":"33ff2fe4-2ab2-480a-8dc8-5a75a988d107","expr":"methods.isEmpty() || methods.iterator().hasNext()","rationale":"If methods is not empty, its iterator must have elements to process in the method body.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.584618481Z"}
{"id":"4aed0f07-71f6-4324-a5ec-9cbf222e8c95","expr":"methods != null && context != null && e != null && !methods.isEmpty() || methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The methods list and context and code emitter e must be non-null for this method to execute; it iterates over methods which may be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.593402554Z"}
{"id":"35af3bff-4161-46f7-a2e8-be13807a67b9","expr":"!methods.isEmpty() || true","rationale":"The method processes the methods list only if not empty; otherwise the method completes without processing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.593402554Z"}
{"id":"5b0621d4-8d22-46c7-abed-728e8e352cf5","expr":"impl != null","rationale":"impl is used to call getName(), so it must be non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.617569942Z"}
{"id":"450ea8a9-8ea4-491c-b6c6-2ae658f5fdc2","expr":"impl.getName() != null","rationale":"getName() is concatenated with a string, so it must be non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.617569942Z"}
{"id":"ea4cc48f-e421-4690-bde7-7dc09b4e7d94","expr":"impl.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Typically method names are non-empty strings","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.617569942Z"}
{"id":"734e1748-50c3-46e6-92cf-ea74bc5dd673","expr":"impl.getName().indexOf('$') == -1","rationale":"To avoid confusion with $Method suffix","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.617569942Z"}
{"id":"164ebf2b-0969-43b0-9ad6-b9f6caa6a7c8","expr":"impl.getName().equals(impl.getName())","rationale":"impl.getName is consistent on each call","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.617569942Z"}
{"id":"e6e3addd-d245-4843-b401-021efaa0356a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"result is formed by concatenation of impl.getName() with a constant string, so it should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.640212395Z"}
{"id":"6ad65ada-2a27-4a2b-a858-9ec9b29d6568","expr":"result.startsWith(impl.getName())","rationale":"result always starts with the signature's name impl.getName().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.640212395Z"}
{"id":"4ef0d36c-de9d-4d85-a3a9-dca5081d1a37","expr":"result.length() == impl.getName().length() + 7","rationale":"result length equals impl name length plus length of the suffix \"$Method\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.640212395Z"}
{"id":"6c087b0a-4495-4dc2-9f8a-f3b000756784","expr":"impl != null","rationale":"The method getMethodProxyField calls impl.getName(), so impl must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.663759564Z"}
{"id":"e17ef609-16ab-4cc0-ba34-4fee01498035","expr":"impl.getName() != null","rationale":"The method concatenates impl.getName() with \"$Proxy\", so the name must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.663759564Z"}
{"id":"37d35670-ce37-4cfa-b083-1841f2a0026a","expr":"impl.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Method signatures typically have names that are non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.663759564Z"}
{"id":"045ae61f-080c-498f-b605-38c37c782c30","expr":"impl.getName().indexOf('$') == -1","rationale":"The method appends \"$Proxy\", so the original name likely does not contain '$' to avoid conflicts.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.663759564Z"}
