{"id":"1daa49de-5652-4788-80b9-a6cba888e251","expr":"result.length() == impl.getName().length() + 6","rationale":"The length of result equals the length of impl.getName() plus the length of \"$Proxy\" (6).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.686936615Z"}
{"id":"53466688-61e7-49fb-92f9-4e6760d25a0f","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The ClassEmitter parameter 'ce' is essential for code generation to proceed and thus should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.710392241Z"}
