{"id":"356d2f64-bff7-42b7-9380-ace01d2481d7","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The method likely requires a valid ClassEmitter to generate bytecode; therefore, ce should be non-null at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.734294981Z"}
{"id":"75751080-32d2-46ef-be0d-2e202b305416","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The Context object is used to obtain implementation signatures and method indexes, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:05:44.734294981Z"}
