{"id":"9f6b70f9-d3c1-4a1d-a418-e5c32c7b845b","expr":"type.getDeclaredConstructors().length > 0","rationale":"There must be at least one constructor available (usually the default or explicit) to instantiate","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.BeanCopier#firstInstance(Class):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.108657160Z"}
{"id":"e046afdc-e4be-425a-af74-e8c397d23c6b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a new instance and thus cannot return null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.BeanCopier#firstInstance(Class):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.123375046Z"}
{"id":"3e0fb0ea-f745-4ef1-8da6-d430638fc204","expr":"type.isInstance(result)","rationale":"The returned object must be an instance of the given type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.BeanCopier#firstInstance(Class):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.123375046Z"}
{"id":"e24c79a6-2092-4aa9-9e85-664ed223ee46","expr":"result.getClass() == type","rationale":"The created instance's exact class matches the provided Class parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.BeanCopier#firstInstance(Class):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.123375046Z"}
{"id":"84f87a13-b820-45eb-a3cf-6c9e730c47e5","expr":"result.getClass().isAssignableFrom(type)","rationale":"The result's class is assignable from the requested Class type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.BeanCopier#firstInstance(Class):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.123375046Z"}
{"id":"4ae340b4-75fe-48a0-974f-a66fb06e792b","expr":"true == (result != null) == (instance != null)","rationale":"Since result == instance, they share the same null status.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.BeanCopier#nextInstance(Object):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.123900754Z"}
{"id":"528970a4-7b67-4be4-8c50-b7063b3d2519","expr":"!(result != null && instance == null)","rationale":"No possibility that result is non-null and instance is null given result == instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.BeanCopier#nextInstance(Object):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.123900754Z"}
{"id":"1d2a2726-5df4-49a1-b030-03950e7d80be","expr":"source != null","rationale":"Given that setContextClass and setNamePrefix likely operate on a non-null class, source should not be null here.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.Generator#setSource(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.131663936Z"}
{"id":"cd673fbb-a109-42e7-8e10-82efefe93392","expr":"source.getName() != null","rationale":"The source class's name is used as a prefix, so it should return a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.Generator#setSource(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.131663936Z"}
{"id":"8ae20fa0-663c-4e1f-a593-4f40a10c258e","expr":"source.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Class names are usually non-empty strings, so the name prefix should have length > 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.Generator#setSource(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.131663936Z"}
{"id":"7bb1ee03-a9c6-47c0-b9b4-acb7e382f028","expr":"target.getName() != null","rationale":"All Class objects have a non-null name; hence, this is a meaningful invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.Generator#setTarget(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.139698753Z"}
{"id":"ca716c68-126c-4a29-81cf-a0ee955a4ce6","expr":"target.isAssignableFrom(target)","rationale":"A Class object is always assignable from itself, a property of Class objects.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.Generator#setTarget(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.139698753Z"}
{"id":"03a65abb-44c0-4319-9c14-0bbf063c176f","expr":"target.getModifiers() >= 0","rationale":"Class modifiers are non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.Generator#setTarget(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.139698753Z"}
{"id":"971cadc2-ebaf-4a0e-8b30-881984262b67","expr":"target.getPackage() != null || target.getName().indexOf('.') < 0","rationale":"If the class has no package, its name contains no dot; otherwise, package is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.Generator#setTarget(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.139698753Z"}
{"id":"38f06d01-c755-4ef4-b6e8-ee3dbd6fe579","expr":"source != null","rationale":"The parameter source is used directly to set context class and name prefix; it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.Generator#setSource(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.140541534Z"}
{"id":"00b6d855-efa9-4ed4-97b9-97d04f43f905","expr":"source.getName() != null","rationale":"The method calls source.getName() to set a prefix, and getName() is guaranteed not to return null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.beans.Generator#setSource(Class):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/beans/BeanCopier.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:04.140541534Z"}
