{"id":"f323af06-1fae-4e39-a981-ef3286324996","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The method uses descriptor to add a constant class symbol and does not check for null, so descriptor must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:06.254906068Z"}
