{"id":"16814388-52e8-4f6c-9590-c5b9cce89e66","expr":"descriptor.startsWith(\"[[\") || !descriptor.contains(\"[\")","rationale":"The descriptor should start with at least one or two '[' characters indicating array dimensions for a multi-dimensional array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:06.254906068Z"}
{"id":"31279666-7564-4182-b997-506be0afdcf7","expr":"numDimensions <= 255","rationale":"numDimensions is stored as a byte, so it must be within 0 and 255 inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:06.254906068Z"}
{"id":"62451e66-f59e-46f8-afd5-e6d7d42b9cf4","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"Annotations have a valid non-empty descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:06.299284783Z"}
{"id":"98f3c30c-d752-4c4f-9562-884ae735fbaf","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"typeRef should be a non-negative integer as it encodes annotation type reference flags.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:06.299284783Z"}
{"id":"ba73cc6b-34dc-4bcb-8357-024be591631a","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.isEmpty() || typePath.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"TypePath if not null is either empty or has a non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:06.299284783Z"}
{"id":"45acab21-3242-4b78-a0ac-39946201ebe1","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean and can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:06.299284783Z"}
{"id":"2492407e-5909-4ad5-a6a5-b23baa54344f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an AnnotationWriter created from AnnotationWriter.create, which never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:06.306878351Z"}
{"id":"2305c290-8d21-47bb-b1dd-22bc108e37af","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The start Label is used directly in creating a new Handler instance, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:06.386957131Z"}
