{"id":"0e85a065-d3e4-47a6-9376-aa7f6f31df0f","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean parameter, representing if an annotation is visible at runtime.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:06.426155553Z"}
