{"id":"d5c352af-92a1-4b85-aa32-cbe806684fd5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns the result of AnnotationWriter.create which is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:06.498552536Z"}
