{"id":"eb6f775f-f11d-469e-ab2a-f06b067a75aa","expr":"result >= 8","rationale":"When not copying from an existing method, minimum returned size starts from 8.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#computeMethodInfoSize():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:36.234513729Z"}
{"id":"eb564f7c-078e-46f0-b95d-7a5bca79b8fd","expr":"result < 65536 + 40","rationale":"The total size includes code length plus overhead; size is bounded due to code length limit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#computeMethodInfoSize():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:36.234513729Z"}
{"id":"55b35db4-0423-4e38-990e-5bcafc615cc1","expr":"result != 0","rationale":"The returned size reflects method_info length which cannot be zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#computeMethodInfoSize():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:36.234513729Z"}
{"id":"f7a8e58d-2e4d-490a-8b3f-10c536d8799d","expr":"output != null","rationale":"The 'output' ByteVector parameter is expected to be non-null to receive method_info data.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:38.411741760Z"}
{"id":"5822ea01-5e27-419e-9e60-b758b49487be","expr":"output != null","rationale":"Output must be non-null to put method info bytes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:38.624036617Z"}
{"id":"991ba061-07b0-44dc-99da-30df44e7bb2c","expr":"output.length >= 0","rationale":"Invariant reflecting valid length of output ByteVector.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:38.624036617Z"}
{"id":"96d780a4-cca1-4686-955e-bd9fcde5a059","expr":"output.length >= 8","rationale":"At method exit output contains at least header bytes written.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:38.624036617Z"}
{"id":"4b660009-39a1-4b55-a5aa-b512e54f86e3","expr":"!output.isEmpty()","rationale":"Output must contain some data after putMethodInfo is called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:38.624036617Z"}
{"id":"85ef2780-e59f-4d49-bca7-79e141400431","expr":"output.data != null","rationale":"The ByteVector's internal byte array containing the data must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:38.624036617Z"}
{"id":"fce766b6-dadb-4b3e-869b-191e14a9e8d4","expr":"attributePrototypes != null","rationale":"The method operates on attributePrototypes by calling its methods, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#collectAttributePrototypes(Attribute.Set):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:39.331734110Z"}
{"id":"a5c68c41-ddc6-42e8-83ff-a017f8637d14","expr":"!attributePrototypes.isEmpty()","rationale":"The set of attribute prototypes likely contains some elements to collect from.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#collectAttributePrototypes(Attribute.Set):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:39.331734110Z"}
{"id":"db0277f2-cc1c-4500-b90e-91af86c0ae30","expr":"attributePrototypes.size() >= 0","rationale":"The size of a Set is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#collectAttributePrototypes(Attribute.Set):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:39.331734110Z"}
{"id":"1d2b255c-f443-4247-afec-6c7fe711bf5b","expr":"attributePrototypes != null","rationale":"The parameter attributePrototypes is expected to be non-null as it is used to collect attribute prototypes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#collectAttributePrototypes(Attribute.Set):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:39.883699585Z"}
{"id":"ef9487b6-e224-4928-91bb-6ab7035211ac","expr":"attributePrototypes.size() >= 0","rationale":"attributePrototypes being a set should never have a negative size after attributes are added.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#collectAttributePrototypes(Attribute.Set):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:39.883699585Z"}
{"id":"21791166-f8be-4f71-9701-26d7286763e3","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"The version encodes the class version and should not be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:42.924580186Z"}
{"id":"02cfbd30-9345-45fb-8a89-042902aa6e36","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The internal name uniquely identifies the class and should be a valid non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:42.924580186Z"}
{"id":"1e53b666-b79c-4735-8ea8-72e66d6653de","expr":"(access & ~(0xFFFF)) == 0","rationale":"Access flags represent modifiers and flags, typically fitting within a mask.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:42.924580186Z"}
{"id":"59042511-837e-406a-9164-3acda0791bb8","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"Class file versions are non-negative integers combining major and minor versions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:43.176576531Z"}
{"id":"ee06e8b2-f15a-4515-81bb-acfbbbc3d945","expr":"name != null","rationale":"A class must have a non-null internal name except for the root Object class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:43.176576531Z"}
{"id":"b2cb6ac8-57d7-491c-b675-6680b6353f85","expr":"superName == null || !name.equals(superName)","rationale":"The superName is either null (Object class) or different from name (class doesn't extend itself).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:43.176576531Z"}
{"id":"67b4b493-65b6-48a1-b2b0-8b740fb08956","expr":"interfaces == null || interfaces.length >= 0","rationale":"interfaces may be null or a valid array with length >=0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:43.176576531Z"}
{"id":"0e319696-3d20-434e-bafe-e8b3b11f5607","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() > 0","rationale":"Signature is either absent (null) or present as a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:43.176576531Z"}
{"id":"6659b6df-9770-4c06-a04f-f36f881900fb","expr":"source == null || source.length() > 0","rationale":"The source string, if present, likely contains a meaningful filename.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:43.883197303Z"}
{"id":"d5d28235-c560-4232-b400-31890b897987","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() > 0","rationale":"The debug string, if present, likely contains meaningful debug information.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:43.883197303Z"}
{"id":"850a39af-4a2e-41d4-980c-ff90364462f3","expr":"(source == null && debug == null) || (source != null || debug != null)","rationale":"At least one of source or debug can be non-null or both can be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:43.883197303Z"}
{"id":"2182df07-0623-47b6-b38a-322fb2fe2bab","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Name is expected to be a fully qualified module name, which cannot be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:44.126695496Z"}
{"id":"d377f43b-00ae-4b8e-94c8-f8e831d7d6fc","expr":"Integer.bitCount(access) <= 3","rationale":"Access flags correspond to combinations of known flags ACC_OPEN, ACC_SYNTHETIC, ACC_MANDATED so at most 3 bits set.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:44.126695496Z"}
{"id":"6f49b55b-915b-49ff-8782-57fc8430fd79","expr":"version == null || !version.isEmpty()","rationale":"version is optional but if non-null should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:44.126695496Z"}
{"id":"7fb161ec-3216-4e3a-a5aa-ad0a62031b9b","expr":"name.indexOf('.') == -1 || name.indexOf('.') > 0","rationale":"Name is fully qualified thus if dots exist they are not at start.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:44.126695496Z"}
{"id":"3dc571c3-0d94-4a1a-9aa9-ca3c049e2fdc","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags are typically stored as non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:44.126695496Z"}
{"id":"5d7c0c2a-ab7c-4988-96e9-afcd7faa8b52","expr":"name != null || result == null","rationale":"If the method returns a non-null ModuleVisitor, then the name parameter was passed to cv.visitModule and likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:45.063748284Z"}
{"id":"f77a3a56-287e-4df1-92d1-0e4c6eb6f69d","expr":"nestHost != null && !nestHost.isEmpty()","rationale":"The nest host class name should be a valid internal class name string","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:47.728583260Z"}
{"id":"7272a790-bea4-424e-8a10-a1a047be59c5","expr":"!nestHost.contains(\".\")","rationale":"ASM internal names use slashes instead of dots, so the nestHost string should not contain a dot","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:47.728583260Z"}
{"id":"ecda7636-9a78-445f-82b7-7a3d7dfc216e","expr":"Character.isJavaIdentifierStart(nestHost.charAt(0))","rationale":"A class internal name should start with a valid Java identifier start character","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:47.728583260Z"}
{"id":"5e8dad8c-c08c-4687-a68b-a77a11c0d145","expr":"nestHost.indexOf(0) != '/'","rationale":"The internal name should not start with a slash character as per conventions","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:47.728583260Z"}
{"id":"1d00d743-900c-461e-a789-0b39ee4096f6","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"Since the enclosing class internal name is mandatory for identification, owner is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:48.458495419Z"}
{"id":"43920607-0e5f-4ab8-b955-6e1584cec3ad","expr":"(name == null) == (descriptor == null)","rationale":"The method Javadoc specifies that both name and descriptor are null if the class is not enclosed in a method or constructor; otherwise both are non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:48.458495419Z"}
{"id":"d6520e27-7b9a-432e-aaa0-c3b4f12aff31","expr":"name == null || name.length() > 0","rationale":"The 'name' parameter, if representing a method name, should not be empty to be a valid method identifier.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:48.458495419Z"}
{"id":"c379e1ca-830e-4e2e-90a4-a6a0520c78d8","expr":"descriptor == null || descriptor.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"Java method descriptors begin with '(' followed by the parameter types, so start with '(' validates this invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:48.458495419Z"}
{"id":"a600b5da-9214-43d4-9f22-5f1ae8670c07","expr":"owner.length() > 0","rationale":"The internal name of a class is expected to be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:48.458495419Z"}
{"id":"ddd19322-5d26-4597-8528-df659e5ae43b","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor parameter represents a class descriptor for the annotation class, so it is expected to be non-null when this method is called.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:49.751447804Z"}
{"id":"ef258deb-4813-42e3-8bf0-2f71270fed81","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"Since visible is a boolean parameter, it must either be true or false at this point.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:49.751447804Z"}
{"id":"e1852b0f-5264-4607-8c9b-9792f2f1bcbd","expr":"descriptor.length() > 2","rationale":"The descriptor string representing the annotation class should be at least a minimal length to hold a valid name surrounded by the expected 'L' and ';' characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:49.751447804Z"}
{"id":"8e53aa4f-cee5-46fa-82de-3fde22b1b665","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.isEmpty()","rationale":"typePath may be null or represent a path; if non-null, it might be empty indicating no sub-element.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:51.441588689Z"}
{"id":"f1d6be43-2ba7-4e0b-9ce6-34dc617295a6","expr":"(typeRef & 0xFF) == typeRef","rationale":"typeRef encodes type reference information in its low bytes part, often needing to be within byte range.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:51.441588689Z"}
{"id":"0b7feffc-5200-45b3-92d4-7dded49f466d","expr":"true == visible || false == visible","rationale":"visible parameter represents runtime visibility and is a boolean.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:51.441588689Z"}
{"id":"a6d176c7-beaf-4c09-a0e3-472fcb78b0c8","expr":"descriptor.length() > 1","rationale":"descriptor should have some meaningful length for a class descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:51.441588689Z"}
{"id":"038da7aa-2123-400d-a30c-e0d6603e5b80","expr":"descriptor != null || result == null","rationale":"The method likely returns null if descriptor is null, so result is null when descriptor is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:52.590978374Z"}
{"id":"8bbd195f-49d3-44f9-8c5d-e2a619cd6e12","expr":"result == null || (descriptor != null && visible == true) || (descriptor != null && visible == false)","rationale":"Expands the conditions under which the method may return non-null result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:52.590978374Z"}
{"id":"9c9eaa8a-1bdd-422b-848c-e4baad36c29b","expr":"result == null || descriptor.length() > 0","rationale":"If the method returns a visitor instance, descriptor is expected to be meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:52.590978374Z"}
{"id":"26154793-0f07-47db-8827-fbfbb8c446ab","expr":"attribute != null","rationale":"The method is called with an attribute parameter that is expected to be non-null according to the standard usage.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:53.239572395Z"}
{"id":"a752b1a5-db16-4bf1-b13e-bda600053423","expr":"attribute.isUnknown() || attribute.isKnown()","rationale":"Attributes usually have a way to check if they are known or unknown; this represents typical classification state.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:53.239572395Z"}
{"id":"9b88d524-de8b-4a2c-91da-8cc2afb049fb","expr":"attribute != null","rationale":"Ensures that the attribute parameter is valid for processing.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:53.248375453Z"}
{"id":"029313ee-af01-4c64-b071-375cc01c5a33","expr":"attribute.isUnknown()","rationale":"The attribute is expected to represent a non-standard attribute, which typically means it is \"unknown\".","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:53.248375453Z"}
{"id":"44dc9464-0e75-4fd7-867e-30da3666b89d","expr":"attribute.type != null","rationale":"The attribute's type field identifies the attribute type and is expected not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:53.248375453Z"}
{"id":"611fc124-8ab9-4cb4-85fb-3ae23ab44cea","expr":"attribute.isCodeAttribute() == false","rationale":"Ensures the attribute is not a standard code attribute.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:53.248375453Z"}
{"id":"b53fc437-960e-42d4-9afb-b90904aef447","expr":"attribute.length >= 0","rationale":"Ensures valid attribute length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:53.248375453Z"}
{"id":"b6b0b772-b5f7-422b-9882-b7e68c7f71c2","expr":"(!visible && result == null) || visible","rationale":"The returned AnnotationVisitor may be null only if the annotation is not runtime visible.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:54.516652193Z"}
{"id":"8a7c8233-b461-44fe-b2fe-bf05c9e85641","expr":"nestMember != null","rationale":"The parameter must represent a valid internal class name, thus non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:56.751214689Z"}
{"id":"2f775d05-d373-40db-8229-60a8444414ac","expr":"!nestMember.isEmpty()","rationale":"A valid nestMember string should have a positive length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:56.751214689Z"}
{"id":"e63b9798-9b49-49ef-92a5-fa736fb9393e","expr":"!nestMember.contains(\".\")","rationale":"Ensures the internal name format is correct, avoiding dots in class names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:56.751214689Z"}
{"id":"169cb952-b2e5-4707-be3e-c596467f1f01","expr":"nestMember != null","rationale":"The parameter nestMember is expected to be a valid internal class name, thus not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:57.209248914Z"}
{"id":"cda0c3f9-ac87-4ebb-aa4d-bef923b3f697","expr":"!nestMember.isEmpty()","rationale":"nestMember should represent a class internal name, which cannot be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:57.209248914Z"}
