{"id":"5f96b8a7-0e87-4a0d-8595-56faa9316235","expr":"permittedSubclass != null && !permittedSubclass.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method accepts a permitted subclass string which typically should be a valid internal name representation, generally non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:06:59.556437621Z"}
