{"id":"cd911675-05ec-41ba-b7d3-3cd633ffcd4b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a Type instance representing the given Method, which should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:07:20.290981533Z"}
