{"id":"ce706df8-4e5a-44e4-80cd-49cec2b5172b","expr":"clazz.isArray() || clazz.isPrimitive() || !clazz.isArray()","rationale":"The method expects clazz to be an object class, primitive class, or array class as per documentation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getDescriptor(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:07:57.528263839Z"}
