{"id":"d4c6a04a-309e-4f7f-9ce3-95811a020ea1","expr":"result.length() > 2","rationale":"Even a method with no parameters and void return still produces a descriptor at least '( )' + descriptor for return type, thus result length must be greater than 2.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodDescriptor(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:06.092908740Z"}
