{"id":"8dff5176-ba03-4326-a99e-e27bccfd3d24","expr":"(clazz.isPrimitive() || !clazz.isPrimitive())","rationale":"This is tautological and could be omitted, included here only to illustrate relationships.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#appendDescriptor(Class<?>,StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:10.993064817Z"}
{"id":"978684e2-5612-44ba-a80f-b796edd08c43","expr":"clazz.isArray() == (stringBuilder.length() > 0 && stringBuilder.charAt(stringBuilder.length() - 1) == '[')","rationale":"The method appends '[' for each array dimension of clazz, so stringBuilder ends with '[' if and only if clazz was an array or had an array component.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#appendDescriptor(Class<?>,StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:12.451880697Z"}
