{"id":"dcf79fdb-4362-4335-b6be-c59d7b75c95c","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"Since sort represents a type category, its result is expected to be a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getSort():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:15.032430083Z"}
{"id":"96fb01fe-c822-4568-94c9-49c1b1e526b5","expr":"result <= 11","rationale":"The getSort method returns one of a known set of constants that correspond to integers in a certain range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getSort():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:15.032430083Z"}
{"id":"3dcadc28-df2b-450c-88dc-c894fa5d14c6","expr":"result != 9 || result == 8","rationale":"The method returns sort == INTERNAL ? OBJECT : sort, so all returns are either different than 9 or equal to 8.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getSort():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:15.032430083Z"}
{"id":"d06f886b-b286-4e57-bd10-afceed3f2784","expr":"result == 8 || result != 9","rationale":"This corresponds to the method redirecting INTERNAL sort to OBJECT.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getSort():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:15.032430083Z"}
{"id":"2629de76-ff2a-4d09-9cae-a2fbd291ef2a","expr":"result == 8 || (result >= 0 && result <= 11 && result != 9)","rationale":"The method replaces INTERNAL with OBJECT before returning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getSort():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:15.032430083Z"}
{"id":"af1bcac2-eea2-4cec-a48f-0e11db8d8b85","expr":"result >= 1","rationale":"The number of dimensions of an array type is always at least 1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getDimensions():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:16.372213284Z"}
