{"id":"730ffc8a-929e-4f79-b721-94ad680a7905","expr":"constructor != null","rationale":"The constructor object must be non-null to invoke methods on it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getConstructorDescriptor(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:16.508211750Z"}
