{"id":"c209fa47-6c88-4487-926f-a7ce320ef823","expr":"constructor.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"The declaring class for the constructor must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getConstructorDescriptor(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:16.508211750Z"}
{"id":"34f50a3f-0c87-4ce1-b3ae-d68f034d5bc3","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"The number of arguments returned by getArgumentCount should be non-negative because negative counts of arguments are invalid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentCount():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:08:19.714171900Z"}
