{"id":"a2692d66-758b-47a0-b184-b06a04dacbee","expr":"result == null || result.getClass() != null","rationale":"If the method returns a non-null result, it must be a valid MethodVisitor instance with a class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#getDelegate():MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:20.894777940Z"}
{"id":"6be8fc9c-39ed-4bd2-ba9f-007c76f3ba12","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags represent bitfield constants and must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:23.637165727Z"}
{"id":"8d46d90d-4bb2-4230-abac-c2649c5f9ee7","expr":"(access & ~0x07) == 0","rationale":"Only ACC_FINAL, ACC_SYNTHETIC and ACC_MANDATED flags are allowed, so bits outside these are unset.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:23.637165727Z"}
{"id":"d907a07b-5e7a-44c3-a2ce-5df979201fbc","expr":"name == null || !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The parameter name may be null or a valid non-empty name if provided.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:23.637165727Z"}
{"id":"f08e73ee-c5f6-4338-bdb5-d7b27f7e4548","expr":"name == null || name.length() <= 255","rationale":"Restricts the length of the parameter name if not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:23.637165727Z"}
{"id":"8f0a47ac-4c43-449a-a4ad-9070f4dcc04c","expr":"access >= 0 && access <= 7","rationale":"The access flags are a combination of ACC_FINAL (0x0010), ACC_SYNTHETIC (0x1000), and ACC_MANDATED (0x8000), but in integer representation they combine to a value within this range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:23.897614269Z"}
{"id":"cf41de32-a097-432d-add3-19e8ef3b9c26","expr":"name == null || !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Parameter names are typically meaningful strings or null, not empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:23.897614269Z"}
{"id":"3a022944-3b47-4908-b953-5a90f3cbfe1b","expr":"(access & ~(1 | 0x1000 | 0x8000)) == 0","rationale":"This restricts access to only valid flag bits.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:23.897614269Z"}
{"id":"060d4979-fdc9-4f12-b7f6-399ae9b5743a","expr":"name == null || (name.length() > 0 && !name.trim().isEmpty())","rationale":"Parameter names typically should not be blank whitespace strings.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:23.897614269Z"}
{"id":"c6bc6c0a-26f5-4dd2-999f-5a27431e8107","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags use bit masking, so access is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:23.897614269Z"}
{"id":"736bbc97-19e2-4ebd-aeeb-691f0aeed56f","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor represents the annotation class descriptor and is used directly in the method call; hence it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:24.484496173Z"}
