{"id":"4945ff6c-55bf-4f00-90ee-665f62b9490a","expr":"result == null || result.getClass() != null","rationale":"Any non-null object has a non-null Class object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotationDefault():AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:24.676016608Z"}
{"id":"0353e76d-4afa-4360-a7f0-dac568aa668a","expr":"parameterCount >= 0","rationale":"The number of parameters that can have annotations must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotableParameterCount(int,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:26.561040171Z"}
{"id":"93e75c71-245b-4781-8b62-03c8d620aebb","expr":"(visible == true) || (visible == false)","rationale":"The 'visible' variable is boolean and thus is either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotableParameterCount(int,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:26.561040171Z"}
{"id":"16366ca6-fab5-46a9-a37b-50e82fbabee9","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor should never be null as it represents the annotation's class descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.586982363Z"}
{"id":"79237399-7ffb-4ac7-9ce2-d3a5ff972c1f","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"typeRef is typically a bit field or integer encoding a type reference which should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.586982363Z"}
{"id":"239f9f4b-34a2-483b-b280-7ddedc34d5ca","expr":"(typePath == null) || (typePath.getLength() >= 0)","rationale":"If typePath exists, it should have a valid length representing the element path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.586982363Z"}
{"id":"bd3ad28b-6135-4f34-8ae9-23910a2528a9","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"Ensures visible is a boolean, although always true because boolean in Java.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.586982363Z"}
{"id":"b90538d8-e44e-4a2a-8b43-57deebd1b008","expr":"typeRef == (typeRef & 0xFFFFFFFF)","rationale":"Validates typeRef fits in 32-bit int, usually true in Java but included for completeness.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.586982363Z"}
{"id":"02854151-7c84-4ef2-9a8b-7fb0ab3e723d","expr":"parameterCount >= 0","rationale":"Parameter count cannot be negative because it represents the number of parameters that can have annotations.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotableParameterCount(int,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.818680109Z"}
{"id":"693746bf-3520-4c10-a1fa-7bdb7db9e042","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean indicating annotation visibility.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotableParameterCount(int,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.818680109Z"}
{"id":"718c665a-9891-4297-a948-abb6faef63b1","expr":"!visible || parameterCount >= 0","rationale":"Parameter count must be valid when annotations are visible.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotableParameterCount(int,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.818680109Z"}
{"id":"27e83f0a-84a3-4658-9b2e-4abdd60c4578","expr":"visible || parameterCount >= 0","rationale":"Parameter count must be valid when annotations are invisible.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotableParameterCount(int,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.818680109Z"}
{"id":"df36b6f4-d311-4e70-8d05-58b6dabff458","expr":"result == null || result != null","rationale":"This is trivially true but clarifies the possible states for result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.841894448Z"}
{"id":"46aca6de-0272-470e-9452-525c711c6072","expr":"(result != null) == (descriptor != null)","rationale":"Since result is obtained by calling mv.visitAnnotation(descriptor, visible) only if mv != null, implicitly descriptor is expected non-null to get a non-null result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.841894448Z"}
{"id":"580992d0-01c6-4da6-b287-c9a4f92da02a","expr":"result == null || visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"This captures visible's boolean type and relation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:27.841894448Z"}
{"id":"1acfe1da-bbde-4247-a839-7b0a29872022","expr":"parameter >= 0","rationale":"The parameter index is typically non-negative since it represents a parameter position.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameterAnnotation(int,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:30.490258582Z"}
{"id":"74acf7c0-493a-4e86-b000-715cc5bf04d1","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The annotation descriptor is expected to be non-null to describe the annotation's class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameterAnnotation(int,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:30.490258582Z"}
{"id":"f4d407e7-f6b1-4d28-8c10-23dae4c52866","expr":"parameter < 32768","rationale":"The parameter index must be strictly smaller than the number of parameters which typically fits within reasonable bounds.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameterAnnotation(int,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:30.490258582Z"}
{"id":"a0dd59a7-435e-4b84-a579-be8cf39c3a0c","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"The visibility flag is a boolean indicating if annotation is runtime visible.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameterAnnotation(int,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:30.490258582Z"}
{"id":"f4cb794e-7b4a-42ea-870c-7ba18bbf3f87","expr":"attribute != null","rationale":"The attribute parameter is expected to be a valid non-null attribute to process.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:30.581147935Z"}
{"id":"8c1a3df3-0976-48a8-bc5a-575bcc37ec88","expr":"attribute.isUnknown() || attribute.isKnown()","rationale":"An attribute is either unknown or known, assuming these classification methods exist.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:30.581147935Z"}
{"id":"ee317cab-dec1-4047-8ac8-42173b06adbd","expr":"attribute.isCodeAttribute() == false","rationale":"Since visitAttribute handles non-standard attributes, the attribute is not a standard code attribute.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:30.581147935Z"}
{"id":"b0d180ab-92b6-4883-a343-d5d8b5c80283","expr":"attribute.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"The length of the attribute data should be non-negative as it represents size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:30.581147935Z"}
{"id":"b1fc86ff-ee66-4d4c-9f2f-307e18fd5984","expr":"attribute.toString() != null","rationale":"The attribute's toString method should return a non-null string description.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:30.581147935Z"}
{"id":"b49a05d2-14f0-4829-92e6-246650bd26c6","expr":"attribute != null && attribute.isUnknown() == false || attribute.isUnknown() == true","rationale":"attribute may often be non-null because it's passed to another visitor, and its knownness status affects processing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:31.021789015Z"}
{"id":"d0736ef1-df37-476b-be7e-5f91bd7e8455","expr":"attribute != null || attribute == null","rationale":"Nullness of attribute is uncertain; no null check guard is present before calling mv.visitAttribute.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:31.021789015Z"}
{"id":"eba32053-93fc-437c-a1a5-f856a1ef9e66","expr":"result == null || descriptor != null","rationale":"The method likely returns null only if mv is null; otherwise returns an AnnotationVisitor linked to the descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitParameterAnnotation(int,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:31.689287073Z"}
{"id":"148d5d98-cf80-4047-9421-9b47418c8e11","expr":"numLocal >= 0","rationale":"Number of local variables should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:33.367430502Z"}
{"id":"38b29e4c-6fbb-4e42-8b7a-2fb29fd3b36d","expr":"numStack >= 0","rationale":"Number of stack elements should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:33.367430502Z"}
{"id":"061e34fa-e4b7-4f53-97b4-3bcedc6f6c8f","expr":"local != null","rationale":"The local object array should not be null to represent local variable types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:33.367430502Z"}
{"id":"c6f384fd-d0d4-47ba-a883-81e6649ab7d3","expr":"stack != null","rationale":"The stack object array should not be null to represent operand stack types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:33.367430502Z"}
{"id":"53103875-2c7f-448f-8b7d-934b212c2418","expr":"local.length >= numLocal","rationale":"The length of local types array should be at least numLocal because it holds the local variable types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:33.367430502Z"}
{"id":"223558ae-b3a9-4bf3-981b-aa3e751d4eec","expr":"type == 0 || type == 1 || type == 2 || type == 3 || type == 4 || type == 5","rationale":"Type must be one of the defined frame types.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:36.297204930Z"}
{"id":"e5702119-f0c5-4330-9c10-f5b438bedf2b","expr":"numLocal >= 0 && numLocal <= (local != null ? local.length : 0)","rationale":"Number of local variables should be non-negative and no greater than local array length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:36.297204930Z"}
{"id":"1d05201c-264e-4301-8090-f6995ebf5ef8","expr":"numStack >= 0 && numStack <= (stack != null ? stack.length : 0)","rationale":"Number of stack elements should be non-negative and not greater than stack array length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:36.297204930Z"}
{"id":"059814ff-cd05-4362-a37d-95407a42590f","expr":"local != null || numLocal == 0","rationale":"local array can be null only if number of locals is zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:36.297204930Z"}
{"id":"f3f14353-8a8c-46d0-9dd5-3ac197fdb95f","expr":"stack != null || numStack == 0","rationale":"stack array can be null only if number of stack elements is zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:36.297204930Z"}
{"id":"2effd116-aaef-4972-a1cf-e905815dfa94","expr":"varIndex >= 0","rationale":"Local variable indices in bytecode cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:38.916166940Z"}
{"id":"82713bce-6d10-4780-a204-35de15951de8","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode is a non-negative integer since ASM instruction opcodes are defined as positive constants.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:40.736507204Z"}
{"id":"3820e31a-b75c-4fd7-aa4e-eb58c2cfa9cb","expr":"opcode <= 2027","rationale":"Opcode is bounded by the maximum ASM opcode constant value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:40.736507204Z"}
{"id":"98090701-67eb-4973-86bb-907772b0dea3","expr":"opcode >= 21 && opcode <= 54","rationale":"The opcode parameter represents a local variable instruction opcode, which should fall within the known opcode range for load/store instructions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:41.813120265Z"}
{"id":"5c24ae54-e6aa-43ee-a260-a863a9ea58d6","expr":"varIndex >= 0","rationale":"varIndex is the index of a local variable and should be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:41.813120265Z"}
{"id":"58a0a95f-2ae0-471a-ba16-bb8d84f0e30e","expr":"((opcode >= 21 && opcode <= 25) || (opcode >= 54 && opcode <= 58))","rationale":"Opcodes correspond either to load instructions (ILOA...ALOAD) or store instructions (ISTORE...ASTORE).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:41.813120265Z"}
{"id":"8d9cd8c2-1333-458e-b7aa-a66a49ef590a","expr":"!((opcode >= 26 && opcode <= 45) && varIndex == 0)","rationale":"The varIndex parameter is explicitly supplied, so these single-byte var opcodes like ILOAD_0 do not appear here with varIndex as zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:41.813120265Z"}
{"id":"e08b1019-7c85-4574-a16c-a8a1c613940b","expr":"(opcode != 169 || varIndex >= 0)","rationale":"If the opcode is RET (169), varIndex must still be a valid local variable index (non-negative).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:41.813120265Z"}
{"id":"98c7e2b3-6f56-41e9-92e2-f6d52bc10308","expr":"type != null","rationale":"type is specified to be the internal name of a class, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:42.145718020Z"}
{"id":"5f69c21c-7243-4871-abdc-e020e7add473","expr":"type.length() > 0","rationale":"The internal name of a class must have positive length, it cannot be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:42.145718020Z"}
{"id":"f639b820-9d07-4d3f-a2b3-1165bb3bdc27","expr":"!type.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Internal names of classes do not contain spaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:42.145718020Z"}
{"id":"c148a7c8-f3ec-4169-b3f7-f4cf706a5d2c","expr":"type != null && !type.isEmpty()","rationale":"The type parameter must represent the internal name of a class, which cannot be null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:43.705393767Z"}
{"id":"f8ff6ab4-81c6-4211-b28e-4d44990c6588","expr":"(type == null) || (type.indexOf('/') >= 0)","rationale":"Internal names of classes replace '.' with '/' so the type string typically contains '/' character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:43.705393767Z"}
{"id":"e1dedd07-c847-45db-9316-20f960192497","expr":"opcode >= 178 && opcode <= 181","rationale":"The opcode represents a field instruction opcode which must be in the range of known field opcodes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:44.330637862Z"}
{"id":"338c772c-e91c-4c1c-b702-06836f346ea9","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"Owner represents the internal name of the class owning the field and so should be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:44.330637862Z"}
{"id":"dfe586f2-d637-47b4-ba9b-e78d4697d72a","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Name must be a valid field name and therefore non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:44.330637862Z"}
{"id":"e5cea93c-067e-41f2-82f2-6da37a787932","expr":"opcode == 178 || opcode == 179 || opcode == 180 || opcode == 181","rationale":"The method expects opcode to be one of the field instruction opcodes: GETSTATIC (178), PUTSTATIC (179), GETFIELD (180), or PUTFIELD (181).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:46.546429090Z"}
{"id":"d680a75b-6319-489d-b44b-f0f688204baf","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"The owner string represents the internal name of the field's owner class and should be non-null and not empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:46.546429090Z"}
{"id":"9ac36db9-838e-442d-bc42-738d4f3e45d4","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The name must be a valid field identifier, thus it is non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:46.546429090Z"}
{"id":"d793572f-94f5-4825-950f-359a54d4851e","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"The descriptor should describe the field type, so it should be a non-null, non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:46.546429090Z"}
{"id":"c3f09e30-8c54-4d8a-946e-e9603b6c46b8","expr":"(opcode == 178 || opcode == 179) || (opcode == 180 || opcode == 181)","rationale":"The opcode is one of the four possible field instruction opcodes, which are divided into static (GETSTATIC, PUTSTATIC) and instance (GETFIELD, PUTFIELD) ones.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:46.546429090Z"}
{"id":"6acba064-7439-4284-8963-c40e9d6eaaef","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"The owner must be specified as a valid internal class name string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:46.677618888Z"}
{"id":"326dffe1-e3dd-40d0-85ba-0d0bc09c1bf8","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method name should be a valid identifier string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:46.677618888Z"}
{"id":"6f84273e-5eca-46f2-96d8-9c42d32147f2","expr":"descriptor != null && descriptor.startsWith(\"(\") && descriptor.contains(\")\")","rationale":"The descriptor must follow JVM method descriptor formatting.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:46.677618888Z"}
{"id":"544841bb-76f9-40a7-ba12-97bf00d4056a","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The owner of the method must always be a non-null internal class name string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:48.766481742Z"}
{"id":"67647ebd-4e64-4351-8061-8d38ebc43fbf","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Method name must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:48.766481742Z"}
{"id":"dc02f7f2-2de6-4d20-b511-9631050b1cc3","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"Method descriptor must be non-null to describe method signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:48.766481742Z"}
{"id":"1c964ef2-a509-402f-8963-67c25ee38d9e","expr":"opcode == 182 || opcode == 183 || opcode == 184 || opcode == 185","rationale":"Ensures opcode is one of the valid method invocation opcodes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:49.065885321Z"}
{"id":"3e94c4c3-bd24-41d4-a6a5-52dc069b95e0","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"Owner string must be a valid non-empty internal class name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:49.065885321Z"}
{"id":"c58708d6-45c4-4071-a5e7-7426f1ce948a","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Method name string must be valid and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:49.065885321Z"}
{"id":"83265d60-923e-43e5-819b-6a799e5b44e2","expr":"descriptor != null && descriptor.startsWith(\"(\") && descriptor.contains(\")\")","rationale":"Descriptor represents a valid method signature format.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:49.065885321Z"}
{"id":"f79eca99-fba4-4df3-b353-1a613b501b90","expr":"(opcode == 185) == (name != null && descriptor != null)","rationale":"Ensures that if opcode is INVOKEINTERFACE, name and descriptor are non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:49.065885321Z"}
{"id":"0ab60e6a-8eef-47ab-9cd0-e45af3520abb","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method expects a valid method name string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:50.868257528Z"}
{"id":"e5212a43-feda-4911-84a0-32a1f4b10988","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"Descriptor is required to specify the method signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:50.868257528Z"}
{"id":"2fd168ae-95df-4904-920e-d7ac6bc02f9f","expr":"bootstrapMethodHandle != null","rationale":"The bootstrap method handle is essential and cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:50.868257528Z"}
{"id":"bc572e83-3c9c-48b5-a624-8f78a60bf495","expr":"bootstrapMethodArguments != null","rationale":"The arguments array is intended to hold the bootstrap method arguments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:50.868257528Z"}
{"id":"4b6572c4-0f10-4044-b420-c9aa09f47a74","expr":"bootstrapMethodArguments.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"This reflects the varargs nature of bootstrapMethodArguments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:50.868257528Z"}
{"id":"e6d7b5b8-c536-4149-a541-79588cd060ef","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"The owner parameter is expected to be a non-null non-empty internal name of the class that owns the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:51.155421888Z"}
{"id":"20ef08dd-d35a-4721-956f-414e327c2f67","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method name must be non-null and non-empty string for a valid method invocation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:51.155421888Z"}
{"id":"890752d2-1bc7-47d7-8f5c-2d80e2cd3dfa","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"The descriptor string must be valid and non-empty representing method signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:51.155421888Z"}
{"id":"658f78ef-050a-4eed-a422-712ee4a2663f","expr":"(opcode == 184 || opcode == 183 || opcode == 182 || opcode == 185)","rationale":"The opcode is expected to be one of INVOKEVIRTUAL(182), INVOKESPECIAL(183), INVOKESTATIC(184), or INVOKEINTERFACE(185).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:51.155421888Z"}
{"id":"8299d928-0767-415a-a926-08621a89d6fc","expr":"(!isInterface || opcode == 185)","rationale":"The isInterface flag is true only when the opcode is INVOKEINTERFACE, otherwise false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:51.155421888Z"}
{"id":"92f297ad-a861-49f8-aa34-d6e38af3157c","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The 'label' parameter represents the target of the jump and is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:52.543344686Z"}
{"id":"72c720d3-68d7-46f1-a3f4-a53d182ef7f6","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode values for instructions are represented by non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:52.543344686Z"}
{"id":"db514cea-cccb-4636-b030-fdfe91efa247","expr":"(opcode == 167) || (opcode == 200) || (opcode >= 153 && opcode <= 166) || (opcode >= 159 && opcode <= 162) || (opcode == 198) || (opcode == 199)","rationale":"The opcode must be one of the valid jump instruction opcodes (e.g., GOTO=167, JSR=200, conditional jumps between 153 and 166, and null checks 198 and 199).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:52.543344686Z"}
{"id":"27d831be-d738-4712-83e5-a0cfc48329a9","expr":"label != null","rationale":"Since the method semantics require a valid jump target, label should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:53.265407888Z"}
{"id":"f878bf86-eaf4-44fe-b544-0855f1c6c82f","expr":"(opcode >= 153 && opcode <= 167) || (opcode >= 198 && opcode <= 199) || (opcode == 167) || (opcode == 168)","rationale":"This expression reflects that opcode is within the set of recognized jump instruction opcodes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:53.265407888Z"}
{"id":"e4662b37-7f05-418c-92df-7179b5089fee","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is the method's name and should be a valid, non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:54.037258914Z"}
{"id":"cdced93f-427f-409e-bbbe-3127d674e3f0","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'descriptor' parameter must be a valid descriptor string representing the method signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:54.037258914Z"}
{"id":"4d2584de-eee9-4a97-8e2e-f52ab0f32af2","expr":"bootstrapMethodHandle != null && bootstrapMethodHandle.getTag() >= 1 && bootstrapMethodHandle.getTag() <= 9","rationale":"The bootstrapMethodHandle represents a method handle expected to have a valid tag in the range 1 to 9.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:54.037258914Z"}
{"id":"1f769a1d-398b-46e7-882e-1db5fa75fe23","expr":"bootstrapMethodArguments == null || bootstrapMethodArguments.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"bootstrapMethodArguments is expected to be an array or null by the method contract.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:54.037258914Z"}
{"id":"13d67de2-561e-4896-a201-6123965554be","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The method parameter label must be non-null to represent a valid instruction label.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:54.730086971Z"}
{"id":"7a61bcd9-eb9f-4213-90b6-f32f9497a43d","expr":"label.getOffset() >= 0","rationale":"The label's offset is expected to be a non-negative integer representing a valid position in bytecode.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:54.730086971Z"}
{"id":"16b0b37b-1073-4e0d-8c69-4c7447f0507e","expr":"label.isResolved() == (label.getOffset() >= 0)","rationale":"A Label object is considered resolved if it has a valid offset (offset >= 0).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:54.730086971Z"}
{"id":"71b04885-0e87-4daa-89fd-7010983386db","expr":"label.isResolved() || !label.isResolved()","rationale":"omit trivial invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:54.730086971Z"}
{"id":"c8934063-1d6e-4d39-af84-37527790d44e","expr":"label != null","rationale":"Label parameter must be non-null for the visitLabel call.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:55.038076044Z"}
{"id":"24734ab4-7e2b-4566-adf8-447edf46cbe8","expr":"label.toString() != null","rationale":"The label's toString method should be safe and return a non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:55.038076044Z"}
{"id":"400c8d14-92e9-4d60-9033-a0c4069c2075","expr":"label.getOffset() >= 0","rationale":"Labels typically represent a position in bytecode and offsets should be >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:55.038076044Z"}
{"id":"fa0ac084-3b03-4b9e-a98a-32b06c6051a5","expr":"label.hasLine() == (label.getLine() > 0)","rationale":"If a label has an associated line number, then getLine returns a positive value; otherwise not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:55.038076044Z"}
{"id":"c75037b7-29f1-4a3f-bc59-98f534afea08","expr":"label.getOffset() % 2 == 0","rationale":"Label offsets are usually aligned to even numbers in bytecode.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:55.038076044Z"}
{"id":"44914879-2562-49a7-af0d-d54fb87dc9d2","expr":"varIndex >= 0","rationale":"Index of local variable is typically non-negative as per JVM conventions","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:56.482669101Z"}
{"id":"7dfd28ef-afb8-4a0d-bcc4-ed14e6d018ac","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"Incrementing by zero would be pointless, method implies a change","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:56.482669101Z"}
{"id":"ebeba55b-8606-486c-bd47-7bf723350ddb","expr":"increment >= Short.MIN_VALUE","rationale":"IINC uses a signed 16-bit immediate so increment must fit","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:56.482669101Z"}
{"id":"4051efa0-519a-4242-a35f-a34f5bfac417","expr":"increment <= Short.MAX_VALUE","rationale":"IINC uses signed 16-bit immediate so increment must fit","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:56.482669101Z"}
{"id":"b13eec4f-1639-4570-a399-d68d8c8532a2","expr":"value != null","rationale":"The parameter value must not be null as per the method documentation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:56.580258514Z"}
{"id":"bc3729ce-6cdd-4538-a9be-e04bcea22060","expr":"value != null","rationale":"The 'value' parameter must be non-null as stated in the method's documentation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:57.961406740Z"}
{"id":"8c61b33c-03ae-456c-8940-78741d171f03","expr":"max >= min","rationale":"Tableswitch ranges must be non-empty or empty sequences; max should be greater than or equal to min.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:58.218355001Z"}
{"id":"cd415272-de65-42b6-b7cf-90999bebd1eb","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"Labels must be provided as an array for valid handler blocks.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:58.218355001Z"}
{"id":"68110bc8-683d-44f4-8348-bee2b3f77e08","expr":"labels.length >= (max - min + 1)","rationale":"Each key in the range from min to max must map to a corresponding label.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:58.218355001Z"}
{"id":"2631c76b-851b-407f-baf9-6f19f1934850","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"Default handler label must exist for control flow redirection on unmatched keys.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:14:58.218355001Z"}
